<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Ɓu New Testament</book>
  <para style="rem">Copyright</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shilǝn ki Lya a toh ɗi Malkus</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malkus</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shilǝn ki Lya a toh ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malkus</para>
  <para style="ip">Mul lashti lwasbatu ki shilǝn mul tǝptu tiki Malkus gunǝ bal shinwasi iki Yohanna Malkus. Ti yelǝn ki Bitlus kǝni mulkina (Ya 1 Bit 5:13). Lashti mbokǝn toh tǝn, lacǝn lwatbatu kapǝn nda ki ulushelima ɗǝ hwonki 70 kal ki zi' Yesu, a tya ge' luki Loma, lacǝnti kapǝn na lwatbat maki ki shilǝn mul tǝmti ki Yesu. Lwatbatu gopin nǝ usu “Guki shilǝn mul tǝmti atǝn Yesu Almasihu yakǝn ki Lya.” Shilǝn u ɗǝ ussu Yesu mbalǝnni mul kyautǝn nǝ kuma ndǝlti. A yen ndǝltwasi age kushtiwasi, nǝ pekǝtl migatli, nǝ paci' mbalǝn bezǝn lǝɓawasǝn. Yesu a shilǝn tǝn gawasi tǝnti Yakǝn mbalǝn gunǝ mbo tǝngaki tǝ' bǝl mbatlwasi tǝ pekǝtl mbalǝn ɗǝge' bezǝn lǝɓa. Lwatbatu ti ngǝtli nǝ bǝtl ndǝlti a tǝn ulnǝ Yesu pǝli u ngǝtl shilǝnwasi nǝ kushtiwasi. Pati ki shilǝnni sǝpǝlini tǝn kyautǝn ki Yesu age' pati ki mutti mǝkkawasi ki dǝm lǝɓa i mbǝl cin ki mushtwasi nǝ hlillyawasi.</para>
  <para style="is">Unnǝ A giɓi i</para>
  <para style="ip">Likǝ' shitu ki pǝtl dadaɓǝl ki Yesu 1:1-13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kyautǝn ki Yesu a Galili 1:14--9:50.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hillyawasi a Galili ɗǝ lǝttya Ulushalima 10:1-52.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pa'ti ki mutti mkka ki Yesu 11:1--15:47.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tlil lya ki Yesu ge' mil mushti 16:1-20.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Shilǝn ki Lya ki Yahaya Mul Baptisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Gopti shilǝn ki Yesu almasihu, yakǝn ki Lya kǝnngu. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Kan u nǝɗa ki laci ge' lwatbati ki Ishaya mulnjeshinkǝn u, ti ussu, “In ngu an shin mulshinkǝn i ni tǝnnda kina, mulnǝ ti likǝni ki shitu u. <verse eid="MRK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Yal mul tati bi age' dǝlgǝn ti ussu, likǝni Lya shitu nǝ mbatldlwakǝn, likǝnǝ shituwasi.” <verse eid="MRK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yahaya mul baptisma mbi gawasi ge' dǝlgǝn, ti dlǝp shilǝn ki Lya, “Tǝ mbalǝn za pǝl bezǝn lǝɓa a pǝlsi baptisma tingaki tǝ pacisi bezǝn lǝɓa wasǝn ɗa.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Mbalǝn ki galt ki Yahudiya nǝ kum mbalǝn ki Ulushalima is go' mbǝ' mati, a si dlǝp bezan lǝɓa u nǝs pǝli u, i pǝlsi baptisma a dlilka ki Uldun. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yahaya ti nǝ ulki laki a dli ki medlǝn ki Lakumi, nǝ ulkǝndǝdlom ki bati amisi, ulki ɗami wasi zhita nǝ mal du. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Ati dlǝp shilǝn ki Lya, i' usu, “Mulǝn ɗǝ mbǝti ge kalini mul nalti ngǝdlǝni, zhim kaptalan wasi ambǝci ta ngusi a ɓatli wai. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />A miɓo ge mal kǝn ami pǝlikin baptisma, tiɓo nǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya ki zeki ti pǝlikini.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">A pǝli Yesu Baptisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Nǝgu dǝmi Yesu i' mbǝ te' Nazillat ge atl ki Galili, i Yahaya pǝli' baptisma a dlilka ki Uldun. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ɗǝ petuwasi to' ge mali i' en lya abuli, i Yal ki mbatl ki Lya pesul lya kǝnǝ kulu. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />I kum yalon sul lya ɗǝ ussu, “Kiki yakuyini gunǝ ami lyamti, nǝti ami holtugi iye.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shedan Cibǝl Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Alǝbi alǝbi i Yalkimbatl ki Lya dloti i' te' ge' dǝlgǝn, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />A tiki dǝmi, mutti kutl kutl lǝbi upsi, a Shedan ɗǝ cibǝlti, atine' tlu kige' dǝlgǝn a mi' shinkǝnki Lya ɗǝ pǝlliti kyautǝn.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Gop Kyautǝn Wasi a Galili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Kalki dlǝl Yahaya, I Yesu te ge' atli ki Galili, ati dlǝm shilǝn ki Lya. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Ati ussu “Cini apoyi gunki Lya ɓalnja i. Zakǝn pǝtl byazǝn lǝɓa ndǝnǝ nǝ shilǝn ki Lya.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Taki Mi' Lati Lekku Bi Gudul Upsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Ati ɓeuti abi dlilka ki Galili, i' en ki Bitlus nǝ Andalawus yelse wasi, asi lati lekku a dlilka tǝngaki si mi' gopti Kes kǝnǝ. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />I Yesu ulsisu “bǝlǝnnǝn kali, an palkini adǝmni mi' ngau mbalǝn.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Alǝbi alǝbi is za lati lekku wasǝn is bǝlti kali. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Nǝs ɓeu kina ten i' en Yakubu nǝ yelse wasi Yahaya, mil ki Zabadi, a ge Kudǝlǝn ki mali asi likǝ' lekku. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Nǝ' takisi bi'u Alǝbi alǝbi is bǝlti kali. Is za bwaswasǝn Zabadi age Kudǝlǝn ne' mil pǝliti kyautǝn.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mul Du Mi'gadli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Is tege gatl ki Kapalnahum cin shuti, i' Yesu tege lu dopga ki Yahudawa ati kulcisi shǝlǝn ki Lya ɗaɗanu. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Is en ulki gagashinti tǝn ulnǝ ti kulcissi u, tǝn gaki ti kulcissi kǝnǝ gunǝ ti kumti nǝ ndǝlton u, bǝ kǝnǝ mi' lashti zhil ki Musa wai. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Mulǝn ɗa, mul du mi'gatli a ge'lu dopga wasǝn, i' la yali, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />I' usu, “Yalamineki Yesu yakǝn nazalet? Ki mbǝni ki hwotimi bezǝn lǝɓa ya? A manini ki wokǝni, ki yakǝn ki Lya mul zo'mbadl kǝni!” <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />I Yesu mati mi'gatli ki geti, i' usu, “Dǝm shot! Pe' ɗǝ ge mulu!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />I ki i bezǝn mi'gatli i' u mulisi. I' la yali, i' petaka geti. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Kum mbalǝn en ulki gagashinti, is go' gyep yelsǝni, a si u'su, “Yakǝn nǝgu u? A sǝti pyal kushti won ngǝ! Mulu tinǝ ndǝtl ki pi' du mi'gatliyi shilǝn, a si kup shilǝn wasi!” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Alǝbi alǝbi shilǝnni zǝga ko una ge' atl ki Galili.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ndokǝl Kom Ki Bitlus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Nǝ petwasǝn ge' lu dopga ki Yahudawa, ki Yakubu nǝ Yahaya is te libi ki Bitlus nǝ Andalawus. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Kom ki Bitlus ki muɗi atli ti gonti, nǝ te ki Yesu, is piti. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />I' lǝ mati, i' gopi' toh i' tliltilya, i' ndoki, i' hilya ma i' pǝlisi kyautǝn.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ndokǝl Mbalǝn Diɓǝli a Suti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />A suti, kalki ki nda ki cin, is mbǝlli Yesu mi' gonti, nǝ mil mi'gatli. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />I mbalǝn ki ge' gatli kup si domga a kina dlabi. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />I' ndokǝl mbalǝn diɓǝli, ko wongi nǝ unndi gontuwasi, iki pe'kǝl mil mi'gatli diɓǝlli. Ta ndǝgi tǝ mi'gatli shilǝn wai, tǝn gaki simanǝnti.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Zǝga ɗǝ shilǝn nǝ Lya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Nǝ kyau, balu a pa' ciltuwai, I Yesu hilya i' peki, i' zǝga gelu u nǝ bǝ mbalǝn ɗawai u, i' zǝga ɗǝ shilǝn nǝ Lya tyaka <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />I Siman nǝ mbalǝn u nǝ tinesi u is zǝga ɗǝ ngauti. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Nǝs mbitu, is ultisu, “kup mbalǝn ɗǝ ngauki.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />I Yesu ulsisu, “Mǝlǝn ge' gatlu gunǝ kina u, ta dlǝm shilǝn ki Lya ɗa ɗanu. Ulnǝ laki yambǝɗa ungu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />I kup ti tya'tya ge' atl ki Galili a ti dlǝm shilǝn ki Lya a ge' lu dopga ki Yahudawa, a ti pyakǝli' mbalǝn mi'gatli.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ndokǝl Mul Go' Ki Dakǝlti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Mul go' ki dakǝlti i'mbǝ ma Yesu, i' ngusiti i'ngemti, a ti ussu, “Inka ndǝgu, kin ma'paltǝn mul lǝshi ɗa'ti. <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />I ci' gontuwasi gop Yesu, i' ta toh wasi i' tǝnti, i' ultisu, a ndǝgi, a ndokǝlki, dǝmi mul lǝshi ɗati!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Alǝbi alǝbi i dakǝltisi zati, i' dǝm mul lǝshi ɗati. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />I ki i Yesu pi' shilǝn mul ndǝlti, nǝ tǝs zǝga u. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />I' ultisu, “Bǝ pi mullǝn wai. Mǝllǝ le' en lǝɓa, a bǝl Lya ulki okǝtl bezǝn lǝɓa kanwunǝ Musa dlǝmi u tǝn gaki wokǝlti. Pǝli nǝgu tǝngaki tǝ mbalǝn mani ɗa ka ndoki.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ge' shuki nǝgu, i muli peki i go' dlǝp shilǝnni tyai. I gu la Yesu ta man te' ge gatlon a dwaɗǝn ɗǝ ye' dwaɗǝnwai, i' go' dǝp gelu u nǝ mbalǝn ɗa wai u. Ngo nǝ nǝgu, mbalǝn go' mbǝ mati, te' ge lu en.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Ndokǝl Mul ki Tle' ki Mi'gatli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Kal ki mutti ten, nǝ palte' Kapalnahum, is kummi ti a libi. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />I' mbalǝn dom ga diɓǝlli, lu zǝ' a sǝn ma ɗawai, abi dlabi ma. A Yesu ɗǝ pi'si shilǝn ki Lya. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Mbalǝn upsi is mbǝ, is kam Mulǝn tyai ki tle ki mi'gatli. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Saman tǝla'ti ma Yesu wai tǝngaki diɓǝtl ki mbalǝn, is mbulǝn gabini tu' malu u nǝ Yesu ɗa u nǝs mbul gabini u, is shim muli suɗi, nǝ lu muttuwasi.<verse eid="MRK 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Nǝ Yesu en lati mbatluwasǝn u i' ulmul ki tle ki mi'gatlisu, “Yakuyini a paci bazǝn lǝɓa wagi.” <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Mbalǝn mi' lashti zhil ki Musa siki dǝmi a lǝbi, a si shilǝn a mbadli, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />A si ussu, “Ya lakiɗa mulu ɗǝ shilǝn nǝgu? Pǝli' Lya bezǝn lǝɓa ti ɗa! Wokǝn ma' wokǝli yakǝn mbalǝn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yakǝn mbalǝn </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gu shilǝn tǝn yakǝn mbalǝn kǝnɗa</char></note> bezǝn lǝɓa wasi ǝnbǝ Lya kǝn nǝmmwai u?” <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Alǝbi alǝbi i Yesu man ulnǝ si dlǝmti a mbadlu, i Yesu ulsisu, “Yakǝn laki ɗa ki unndi shilǝn u a mbadlwakǝn? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Gukǝn ngǝtli nǝ mbǝlǝ, ti ulmul ki tle usu, ‘A wokǝli bezǝn lǝɓa wagi’ nǝ ta usu, ‘Hilya kam lumuttwagi ki zǝgaya?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Ami lyamti ki manini Yakǝn mbalǝn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yakǝn mbalǝn </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gu shilǝn tǝn Yesu ɗa</char></note> ti nǝ ndǝtl ki wokǝl bezǝn lǝɓa a dǝplaɓa.” I' ul mul ki tle ki mi'gatli su <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“A ulkisu, hilya kam lumuttuwagi ki zǝga libi.” <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />I Alǝbi alǝbi tǝ hilya, i' kam lumuttuwa si, i' peki a kum mbalǝn ɗǝ yetti, a si kup gagashinti, a si natl Lya asi ussu, “Ma en ulǝn nǝgu gason wai.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taki' Lawi bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu peki i' lǝ bi Dlǝlka ki Galili ɗa ɗanu, Mbalǝn diɓǝli is domga a malgǝn wasi, ati kulcisi. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />A ti beuti, i' en Lawi yakǝn ki Halpa ki dǝmi ati kyautǝn ki ka' upki ban. I Yesu ultisu, “Bǝlǝn kali.” I' hilya i' bǝlti kali. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Gason Yesu ɗǝ ɗap ulki ɗami a libi ki Lawi, mul ka' upki ban ne mi'bezǝn lǝɓa nǝ mbalǝn diɓǝli si ɗamti ne'ti ne mil kushti wasi, tǝn gaki mil diɓǝlti gesi mi' bǝtlti ni; <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Nǝ mi' lashti zhil ki Musa si palisiyawani is enti ɗǝ ɗamti nesi, nǝ mi'bezǝn lǝɓa nǝ mi' ka' upki ban u, is ul mi' kushti wasisu, “Ya laki ti ɗamti nǝ tleti ne' mi' kap upki ban nǝ mi'bezǝn lǝɓa ɗa?” <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Nǝ Yesu kumi nǝgu u, i' ulsisu, “Mi' ginǝ bǝ ɗa gontwai u sikǝn lǝ' mamul pǝtl igǝn wai, mi' gonti si ɗǝ ngau mul igǝn. Tǝn gaki mi' pǝtl ze kautǝnkǝn a mbǝɗawai, tǝn gagi mi' bezǝn lǝɓa ni.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyemti a Tǝn pǝtl Kuzǝn Mali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Mi' kushti ki Yahaya mul baptisma nǝ ki palisiyawa si pǝtl kuzǝn mali. Mbalǝn en ngem Yesu is usu, “Yalaki ɗa mi' kushti ki Yahaya nǝ ki palisiyawa si kuzǝn mali gwaɓo si ɗa pǝtl ti wai?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />I Yesu ulsisu, “Yelǝnsi ki mul kutleti sǝn pǝtl kuzǝn mali a mul kutleti nesiya? Tunnǝ mul kutleti nesi u sǝkǝn pǝtl kuzǝn malilwai, <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Cin ɗǝ mbǝti sinkap mul kutletiyi taka ɗǝ masi. Cinisini sǝn pǝtl kuzǝn mali. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Kǝn ca'ti mbulǝn gǝsi nǝ pyal lulutwai. In a caki nǝ nali u, pyal luluti nǝn kyeshti gus lulutisi, nǝn ngǝtlti ki kal nǝ kyeshti. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Kǝn bǝna pyal mal ki mil pǝ' ki annabi ge gus kal ki bati wai. Mun nǝ a bine u, mali si nǝn tatlti kal ki bati si, a hol kal nǝ mal innabi isi. Pyal mal ki mil pǝ' ki innabi, sai nǝ pyal kal ki bati.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mi' Kushti Ki Yesu Go' Cotlti Alkama Cin shuti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Gason cin shuti, Yesu ne mil kustiwasi si ɓeuti ge' gu ki alkama. Sige ɓeuti i mil kusti ki Yesu is go' catl ga alkama en. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />I palisiyawa ultisu, “En ulnǝ mil kushtiwa ɗǝ pǝlti u. Ya laki ɗa si pǝtl ulnǝ zhil ki Musa a ndigi ti pǝlti cin ki shutwai u?” <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />I Yesu njesi shilǝn nisi i' ulsisu, ka kummǝn shilǝn ki ulnǝ Dawuda pǝli u waiya, cin u nǝ kuzǝn gopti, ti ne' yelǝnsi lǝtwaswaiya? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Hwon u nǝ Abiyatal tiki bal lǝɓa, Dauda tege' Libi ki Lya, i' ɗam biledi gunǝ zǝdli u iki bǝl yalǝnsiwasi ginǝ ne'tu, ki ɗami ki lǝɓasi ni nǝgwasǝn mulǝn kǝn ɗamtwai. <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />I Yesu ulsisu, “Pǝlǝn cin shuti tǝngaki mbalǝn, ba pǝlǝn mbalǝn gaki cin shutuwai. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Yakǝn mbalǝn kǝnki mulban ki shuti nǝ ki cin shuti.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Mul nǝ Mi'Gadli tle Toh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />I Yesu te ge' lu dopga ki Yahudawa, mulǝn ɗa alǝbi mul toh kitle ki mi'gadli. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Tǝn gaki sǝmbi shitu ki gopti Yesu ɗa. I mbalǝn yen zid dwaɗǝn, tǝn ndokǝl mulisi cin shutwa? <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />I Yesu ulmul toh ki tle yisu, “Pete' ki akina.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />I Yesu ulsisu, “Ambuni tǝ pǝl ze' lǝɓa ko bezǝn lǝɓa cin shuta? Ti pekǝl mul mǝshti, ko ti tlota?” Is dǝm shot. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Nǝ' yasi nǝ mbadli ki lewi u, ati du mbadli nǝ ɗashti ki mbadlwasǝn, i' ul mulisisu, “Ta' toh wa'teɗi.” Ittakit tye, i toh was pal lǝbi. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Nǝ palisiwa yani nǝgu u is peki, Alǝbi alǝbi is dlil shilǝn nǝ mbalǝn ki Hilidus a tǝnti, kau u nǝ si' tlotu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbalǝn Dom ga Diɓǝli Abi dlǝlka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />I Yesu hilya ne' mil kushtiwasi, is za'gatli is lǝ tya bi dlǝlka ki Galili. Mbalǝn mi' diɓǝlti iye ki Galili is bǝlti kali. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Nǝs kum ulnǝ ti pǝlti u, mbalǝn is mbǝ te' Yahudiya nǝ Ulushalima, nǝ atl ki Edom, nǝ te' bǝ gasi ki dlǝlka ki Uldum, nǝ te'ge luki Taya nǝ Sidom, bal dopga mbǝ mati, tǝn gaki si' kum ulnǝ ti pǝlti u. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Tǝn kitǝlli' ɓa mbalǝn diɓǝli gyemti, i ul mil kushtiwassu shakǝli nǝn kudǝlǝn ki mali nǝm teɗi. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Ti' pǝlin nǝgu u tǝn gaki ta ndokǝl mbalǝn diɓǝlli, i laki ɗa kum mbalǝn mi' gonti si shimga te' mati tǝn gaki si' tǝnti. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Du mi'gatli, ko anǝmi si enti, as nda kinawasi asi lati yali, asi ussu, “Ki yakǝn ki Lya kǝnǝ.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />I' dlǝmisi bǝs pi mbalǝn okǝnki ti wai.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zabǝl mbalǝn kutl nǝ Lop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />I' Yesu totǝn zǝnga, i' taki ginǝ ti lyap siyi bi, is lǝ mati. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />A gesi is zabǝl mbalǝn kutl nǝ lop si' dǝm neti, tǝn gaki ti'go' shi'si asi dlǝm shilǝn ki Lya, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />I' bǝlsi dǝlti ki pekǝl du mi'gatli. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Ginǝs zabǝl siyi kǝngyi, Bitlus, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Nǝ Yakubu yakǝn ki Zabadi, Nǝ yalkewasi Yahaya, i' bǝlsi shin Buwanaljis' mil ki ndaltannaca. <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Iki ɗaɗanu i' zabǝl Andalawus, nǝ Pilibus nǝ Baltamawas, nǝ Matiyu, nǝ Toma, nǝ Yakubu yakǝn ki Halpa, nǝ Taddawus, nǝ Saminu Bakan'ane, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Nǝ Yahuza Iskaliyoti gunǝ bǝl Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nǝ Ba'alzabul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />I Yesu te' libi won, iki i mbalǝn dopga ɗaɗanu hal saman ɗap ulki ɗami wai ti ne' mil kushtiwasi. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Nǝ yelsǝnǝ wasi kumi nǝ gu u, iki is lǝ ɗǝ goptiti, tǝn gaki si usu, “Ga agǝliti.” <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Mi' kushti zhil ki Musa gǝnǝ pete' Ulushalima is usu, “Ba'alzabul kǝn totǝnti! Nǝ ndǝtl ki guu mi'gatlkǝn ti pekǝtl mi'gatli.” <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />I Yesu takisibi, i' cimbǝlisi i' usu, “A u kǝn ti Shaɗan man pekǝtl Shaɗan? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />In gu' a bwasi a tǝn nge yelsǝni u, guntu kǝn lǝ' kinawai. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Nǝgu in libi a bwasi a tǝn nge' yelsǝni u, libi u kǝn lǝ' kinawai. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />In shaiɗan a dlani ga wasu, a bwasi, kǝn lǝ'kinawai, patwas kǝnmbǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Mul ma' te' ge libi ki mul ndǝlti a' em galwasi ɗawai. In ba' kǝndi mul ndǝlti wai u, iki annda yep gal ki libini. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Bali ami pi'kini nǝn paci ko mulu kǝn bezǝn lǝɓawasi, nǝ bezǝn shilǝn u nǝ' tǝpǝli u. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Gunǝ a pǝli Yalkimbatl ki Lya ki gunti bezǝn lǝɓa u, kǝn paci tiwai, nǝ ngatlti ki dǝp lǝɓa.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Gi ɓo si usu, “Du mi'gatli ni'ɗa.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dya ki Yesu ne' Yelsǝniwasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Iki dya ki Yesu ne' yelsǝniwasi is mbǝ. Is dlil a dla, is ta' shinkǝn timmbǝ. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Dop ga ki mbalǝn ki dǝmi a malgǝn wasi, is ultisu, “Dya wa' kǝngu nǝ yelsǝni wagi si kauki a dla.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />I' gyemsi, “ki wokǝn ki dya ini nǝ yelsǝni ini?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />I' ya ginǝ a malgǝn wasi, i' usu, “Dya ikǝngu nǝ yelsǝni ini! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Ko mulu kǝn pǝl ulnǝ Lya ɗǝ lyamti u, tiki dya ini nǝ yelsǝni ini, tiki koli ini ɗaɗanu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Cimbǝlti ki Mul Otlti Lǝɓa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mt 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Lk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Ɗaɗanu Yesu a gop kulci'si shilǝn ki Lya abi dlilka u ɓalu, I' mbalǝn mil diɓǝlti domga amati, I lati, i'te ge' kundǝlǝn ki mali, Adlǝlka, i' dǝm a giɓi. I' dopga ki mbalǝn dlǝl atǝn bǝgasi abi dlǝlka isi. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />I' kulcisi lǝɓa diɓǝli nǝ cibǝlti. A ge kulcisiwasi i' ulsisu, <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Ga kǝn kum! Mulǝn mul kotllu won ɗa is zǝga gegu tǝn gaki ti' wotl o'. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Tige dlati wundi lǝɓa, Ina wundiyen nda tǝn shutu, i yatli ɗakǝn unndiyisi. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Un ndiyen is nda age lu mul zǝnga luwu nǝ bǝ atl ɗa iye wai u. Alǝbi alǝbi is te' tǝn gaki atli loluwai. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Nǝ cin peku, Is landǝli, tǝn gaki dlǝlgwasǝn loluwai, Is kwakǝni. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />I gyen nda age ili, I ili sǝnkǝlsi, Sa man pǝtl gwewai. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />I gyen ɗaɗanu is nda gye lu atl ki zeki, Is te' kizeki, Is nali, Is pǝl gwe, I gyen pǝl gwe kutl kutl lǝbi maki, Gyen kutl kutl lǝbi mǝkka, Gyen kutl kutl lǝbi kutl.” I Yesu usu, <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />“Mul kǝm ki kumti tǝ'kumi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulnǝ Lati Ɗǝ Cimbǝlti u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Nǝs pal mal gǝni u, Mil bǝtlti nǝ kutl nǝ lopiyi iki is gyemti yakǝn cimbǝlti u ɗǝ dlǝmti. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Iki i' ulsisu, “Kini ɓo, a ndǝgikini i kimannǝn tuki libi ki Lya, Gyen ginǝ bǝ ɗa gyekini wai u, Sai nǝ cimbǝlti.<verse eid="MRK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />“ ‘Yenti nǝ dwaɗǝn ɓo, Sa yeniyi, bǝ a mbatldlwai. Kumti ɓo, Sa kumiyi, Sa man ulnǝ ɗǝ dlǝmti u wai, Tǝn gaki, ɓaspaltyai a pacisi bezǝn lǝɓa wasǝn ɗa.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Dlǝm Cimbǝlti Ki Mul Wotlti Unndi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mt 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Yesu ulsisu, “A!, Kimanǝn ciɓǝlti uwayya? Tu i mi kǝnkimanǝn na ciɓǝlti en ɗa? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mul wotlti o' u, Shilǝn ki Lya kǝnti wotlti. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Ginǝ ndatǝn shutu u ɓo, Siki ciɓǝlti ki gǝnǝ wotl shilǝn ki Lya a mbatl dlwasǝn u. Sǝn kup shilǝn nisi, Alǝbi alǝbi a shaidan kam shilǝn u nǝ wotldli a mbadlwasǝn u. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Nǝguni ɗaɗanu gunǝ wotl unndi o' a ge lu zǝnga u, Siki ginǝ sǝn kup shilǝn ki Lya as kami nǝ hwoltugi. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Si ɓo, Gǝs nisi ɗawai, si kǝn dǝm iye wai, ko ulukǝn hwossi tǝngaki shilǝn ki Lya u, Alǝbi alǝbi as pal nǝ kali. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Unndi ginǝ nda gelu ili u, iki ciɓǝlti ki mbalǝn u nǝ kum shilǝn ki Lya u, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />Dǝp lǝɓa a hwosi u, nǝ lyap usǝn u, Nǝ laki lǝɓa u, Nǝnte'ti gesi asǝnkǝl shilǝn nisi, Ashilǝn nisi kǝn dǝmti kizeki masiwai. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Undi u nǝ nda age luki zeki u, iki cimbǝlti ki mbalǝn u nǝkum shilǝnisi, Sǝn kamti, As pǝl kyautǝn nǝ nali, As mbi mbǝlti tǝnki gyen kutl kutl lǝbi maki, Gyen kutl kutl lǝbi mǝkka, Gyenɓo kutl kutl lǝbi kutl.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cibǝlti Atǝn Pitila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu ulsisu, “Nǝn mbǝtl pitila teɗi a idlati nǝ bal gala, ko nǝnzǝdli agǝs lumutti, kin zǝti atǝn lu dǝmtuwa swaya? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Kum ulnǝ ki hwundǝli u, nǝn pekǝlti. Ulnǝ ki kuppi u, nǝn ɗutiti. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Mul kǝm ki kumti, ti' kumi.” <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu ulsisu, “Kumini, ko'talaku' nǝ cimbǝlin ɗa u, nǝ nali si' cimbǝlliki, hal ma as mbǝli ɗa. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Tǝngaki mulnǝ ulǝn ni'ɗa u, sim mbǝli' tiɗa, mulnǝ ulǝn ni' ɗawai u, na' ulnǝ nitu sin kamiti taka.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cimbǝlti Ki Unndu nǝ Ate u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu ulsisu, “Gu' ki libi ki Lya kǝnǝ mul dlati u'kǝni a atli. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Mutti nǝ hillya i undi te, i nali, timan kan u nǝ pǝl dli uwai. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Atli nǝ gawasi ti bǝtl lǝɓa, ki nǝm iki ulnǝ ɗǝ te'ti, sai ga, nǝ balgye laɓa tǝnki. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />In gwe yi a nyau, iki alǝbi alǝbi atlo'dli nǝ kwaltǝn, gis acilu ngu.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cimbǝlti nǝ Gwe' Mastad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />I' usu ɗaɗanu, “Nǝ yakǝn tǝn cimbǝlǝn gu' ki Lya? Ko nǝ yakǝn tǝn cimbǝlǝnti? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Kǝnǝ gwe mastad kǝnɗa, gunǝ, iki yakǝn gwe lǝɓa gunǝ ɗǝ wotlti adǝp lǝɓa u, <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Ngo nǝ nǝgu in wotl tu, an ngǝtl kap na dwa nǝ nalti, ap pǝlbas mil toh, yatl ma as man nda a gwasǝn wasi.” <verse eid="MRK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Nǝ cimbǝlti diɓǝli Yesu dlǝm misi shilǝn ki Lya, ndace nǝ mantiwasǝn. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Ti ɗa pissi ulǝnwai, sai nǝ cimbǝlti. Iki ti pi' mil kushtiwasi ko yanngi a malgǝni bǝ nǝ cimbǝltiwai. <verse eid="MRK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Age'cinisi, nǝ cin ɓalnja ti nda u, i Yesu ul mil kushti wassu, “Mi' ɗakǝcin tyatǝn bi dlǝlka ka.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Nǝsza dopga ki mbalǝn akalu, is zǝga neti kau u nǝ tiɗa u age kundǝlǝn ki mali, na kundǝlǝn ki mali si amalgǝn wasi. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />I bal lya ki mali mul yetǝl dlitoɗi, i bǝski mali go' tliti lya ɗǝ lyap jakǝ' kuɗǝlǝ nisi. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu ɓo ati tu kal age kundǝlǝn ki mali atǝn lumutti, ati nde enbuɗi. Iki mil kushtiwasi is dlilti ɗǝ enɓuɗi, is ultisu, “Mul lashti, mun mǝshti kin ɗa entiwaya?” <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />I' hilya ɗǝ enɓuɗi, i' mati etǝlli, i ultisu “dǝm shot!” Iki i yetǝlli muɗi, i kumlu dǝm shot. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />I' ulsisu, “Tǝn gaki yakǝn lakiɗa ikumǝn ɓanti nǝgu? Hal nǝgun lati mbatl kǝn nuna?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Iskum ɓanti iye, is ulyelsǝnisu, “Wo kǝngu? Yetǝl nǝ mali ki dlika si bǝtl shilǝn wasi!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Ndokǝl Mul Besǝn Migatli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />A Yesu ne mil kushtiwasi is ɓǝci bidlilka age atl ki Galasinawa. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Nǝ pe'tuwasi ɗige kundǝlǝn ki mali, iki mul du mi'gatlon kǝngu te' gelu gum mbalǝn i mbǝ ma Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Ti ɓo lugum mbalǝn kǝn ki lǝ dǝm tuwasi. Mul ma'kǝndǝtti ɗawai, ko nǝ ulkǝndǝ mbalǝn kidom. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Tǝn a tle kǝndǝti toh nǝ asǝn nǝ ulkǝndǝ mbalǝn ki dom, ati ɓaɓatlti, a cacal dom ki tǝn asǝni. Mul ma'pǝliti ulǝn ɗawai. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Gasi nǝ dloncin a gelu gum mbalǝn ti dǝmti, nǝ tǝn zǝga, ati latiyali, ati gǝlǝshti dli wasi nǝ zǝnga. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Nǝ en Yesu te' lolu u, i' em kitǝl tya mati i' gus akinawasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />I' layali i' usu, “Yesu yakǝn ki Lya mul nalti, ya lakǝnmiki? A maki nǝ Lya yi, bǝ hwoti besǝn lǝɓa wai.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Tǝ ndan akinawasi nǝgu u tǝn gaki Yesu ultisu, “Za mulu, Ki du mi'gatli!” <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />I Yesu gyemti, “Ya kǝn ki shinwagi?” I' ultisu, “Shin i kǝnki, hututu, iki mi dimbǝli.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Iki i' go' gyep Yesu bǝ'katsi ɗǝ kiwai <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Amalǝbisi lu byatl dǝs kiban ɗa suttǝn mis calgadli. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Mi'gatli gyemti is usu, “In kandǝgu katmi swa ge dǝs kiban yi, tǝn te gesi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />I Yesu ndǝgisi. Iki yi du mi'gatli peki, is te ge dǝs kiban nisi. Dǝbǝtl ki dǝs kiban nisi sǝn pǝtl zangu lop, is hilya nǝ kitǝl, suttǝn mis calgadli is ndage mali ki dlilka is gǝli. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Aki kǝn mil byatl dǝs kiban ni tlǝ nǝ kitǝl, is su dlǝm shilǝnni age bas gatli nǝ mil gatli. I mbalǝn ɓǝ si' en ulnǝ nda u. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Nǝs ɓǝ ma Yesu u is en mul nǝs pekǝli mi'gatli ngu ki dǝmi, nǝ luluti ki laki adli, ti ge dliwasi ɗaɗanu, is kum ɓanti. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Ginǝs pǝl ulisi a tǝn dwaɗǝn wasǝn u, is go' palli' mbalǝn shilǝn ki ulnǝ nda u nǝ mul mi'gatli nǝ dǝs kiban yi u <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />I mbalǝn nisi pi Yesu ti' zaki atlwasǝn. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Ti te'ge kundǝlǝn ki mali kǝn ngu, mulnǝ da du mi'gatli ɗa u bǝltibi ti' dǝm mati. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yesu a ndǝgi tuwai, i Yesu ultisu, “Lǝ libi ma yalsǝnǝ wagi, a pisi bas ulnǝ Lya pǝliku, nǝ ci'gontuwagu nǝ' eni u.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />I' zǝga libi, i' tege dlǝm shilǝni a Dikapolis ki bas lǝɓa u nǝ Yesu pǝlitu. I kum mbalǝn i kum ulki gagashinti.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndokǝl Yakǝn ki Yayilus nǝ Kǝli mul Bǝna' ki Hwula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Nǝ Yesu ɗakǝci tyatǝn bǝgasi gwa u ge kundǝlǝn ki mali ɗaɗanu u, I bal dopga ki mbalǝn gandǝlti. Ati abi dlilka. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Iki mulǝn ngu age bas mul kina ki lu dopga ki Yahudawa, mul shin Yayilus. Nǝ en Yesu u in nda akina wasi, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />I' bǝlti bi balbali, i' ultisu, “Yakuyini yakǝnkǝli ti abiki mǝshti. Ami bǝtlki bi ngaɗi ki zittoh tǝngaki tin ndoɗa.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Iki is zǝga neti. Bal dopga ki mbalǝn ɗǝ bǝlti kali, asi gyepti. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Iki kǝli won ngu ta pǝl hwon kutl nǝ lobpi a hwula ɗǝ binetti, <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Kǝli u ta tle bal bǝna a toh ki mil bǝlt igǝn diɓǝli, ta gǝl kum ulnǝ ni' ɗa u, i ngo nǝnǝgu tambi ndotuwai, kina kina gonti ɗa. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Nǝ kumi ɗǝ dlǝm Yesu u, i' molti te' kalki Yesu age dopga nisi, i' tǝn bi lulugǝl ki Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Tǝn ti usu a mbatl tluwasi, “Lulugǝl ma atǝni u, an ndoti.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Alǝbi bina' ki hwulawasi dlǝli, i' kumi a dliwasi ta ndoki gontuwasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Alǝbi alǝbi nǝ Yesu kumi ndǝlton a peɗi getu, iki i' go' yalu age dopga, i' usu, “Wokǝn tǝn lulugǝlni?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Iki i mil kushtiwasi ultisu, “Ki ye' dopga ki mbalǝn nǝgu, a usu, wokǝn tǝnka?” <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Iki i Yesu yalu kali tǝngaki ti' en mulnǝ pǝli' nǝgu u. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Kǝli yi nǝ man ulnǝ ndaniti u, iki i' ɓǝ nǝ ɓanti, ati nyepti ki dli i' nda a kina ki Yesu, i kǝliyi pi Yesu bali. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />I Yesu ul kǝli usu, “Yakuyini, lati mbatluwagi a ndokǝlki. Mboci lau, ka ndo ɗǝ gontuwagi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />A tige shilǝn, iki gyenkǝnngi te' libi ki Yayilus, is usu, “Yakuwagi ta mǝci, yalakiɗa ki'la' mul lashti ɗǝ bǝnaɗa?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yesu a pal kǝm tǝn ulnǝ si dlǝmti uwai, i' ul Yayilus su, “Bi kum ɓantuwai, la mbatl katl” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ta za mulǝn a bǝlsi kaluwai iki Bitlus, nǝ Yakubu, nǝ Yahaya yalse ki Yakubu si bǝlti kali <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Nǝs mbǝci libi ki Yayilus mul kina ki lu dopga ki Yahudawa u, is kumi wotilu, nǝ kulu, nǝ latiyali yenti ɗawai ba kumti ɗawai. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Nǝ te' gibi u, i' Yesu ulsisu, “Yalaki ɗa ki wotilu nǝ kulu ɗa nǝgu? Yakǝni kimǝci tiɗawai, nde yemmbukǝn tiɗa.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Iki is pǝli gyetlti ki mbǝlti. Kalki ki Yesu a pekǝl mbalǝn nǝsi kumwasǝn tuwa dlayi, iki i' kan bwasi ki yakǝnkǝliyi nǝ dyawasi nǝ mil kushtiwasi guni netu, is te' gelu u nǝ yakǝn kǝliyi ɗa u. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />I' Yesu goppi toh, i' ultisu, “Talita kumi”, iki, “Yakǝnkǝli, ami utlkisu, hilya.” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Alǝbi alǝbi yakǝnkǝliyi hilya i' go' lǝti. Tǝngaki timul hwon kutl nǝ lop kǝni. Gu lakisi ulki gagashinti iye <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Iki i' matisi bǝ mulǝn kum shilǝn uwai, i' ulsisu ɗaɗanu si' bǝl yakǝn kǝliyi ulki ɗami.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">A Nazalat is nge' Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />I Yesu za' lǝbisi ippal tiya ge' gatluwasi, I mil kushti wasi is bǝltikal. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Nǝ Cin shuti pǝ' u, i' gop kulcissi age'lu dopga ki Yahudawa, diɓǝl mbalǝn yi nǝ lǝbi u si ga'ti kǝmu is kum gagashinti, asi ussu, “A ukǝn mulu mbi ulu nǝgu u?” Is ngemti, “Undi mallaɓa ukǝn ninnǝgu? Undi gagashintu kǝn ti pǝlti nǝgu? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Guki mul tlatti lǝɓa u waiwa? Yakǝn ki Malyamu nǝ yelse ki Yakubu, nǝ Yusupu, nǝ Yahuza nǝ Saminu? Yelsǝni was mudli simi ne'sǝ a kiwu waiwa?” Is nge'ti. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />I Yesu ulsisu, “Mulnjeshinkǝn nǝnɗa mbin nalti ge'gatluwaswai nǝ ge' yelsǝniwasi nǝ a libi wasi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Taman pǝtl ulki gagashit tiya kawai, iki is zi mi'gonti ginǝ bǝs diɓǝllwai u toh is ndoki. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />I' kum gagashinti nǝ hotl la'ti mbadlawasǝn. I'go' duk tiya ge mil gatli ati kulcissi.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Shin Mil kushtiwasi Kutl nǝ Lob</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Immbe mil kushti kutlh nǝ lopi bi is shinsi lob lob. Ibbǝlsi ndǝlti tǝn du mi'gatlǝ. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Ippisi i' usu, “Bǝ kamǝn ulǝnwai ɗǝ lǝ tuwasǝnwai kumɓǝlkǝn ki kamin katl bǝs kan ulki ɗamiwai bǝ kamǝn kulu wai bǝ kamǝn ulpwai. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Shimǝn kaptǝlan, ngo nǝnǝgu bi mbǝlǝn lu'lǝgǝl tǝnkiwai. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Libi u nǝ ka shitin lǝbi u a' dǝmni lǝbi hal a' za'kǝn gatliɗa. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Lu u nǝ bǝsa njekiniwai u ko sa nge kupkini u, za'kǝn gatli abatǝn kushka ki asǝnwakǝn taka gaki tǝdǝm dǝtlkǝm ɗa ma'si.” <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Nǝgu si peki asi dlǝmi' mbalǝn shilǝn ki Lya gaki sǝ' za' pǝtl bezǝn lǝɓa. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Is pekǝl mi'gatli diɓǝli, is suwati mi'gonti diɓǝli mili is ndoki.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushti Ki Yahaya Mul Baptisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Nǝ guu Hilidus kumi nǝgu u, tǝn gaki Yesu apǝl shin i, gemma si usu, “Yahaya mul pǝli mbalǝn baptisma ti tlilya ge' mi' mǝshti, I lakiɗa ti nǝ ndǝlki kyautǝn ki gagashinti ɗǝ pǝ' ma'tiɗa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Gen ɗǝ usu Iliya ni, gen ne si usu, “Nǝm kǝn ge mul njeshinkǝn ki Lya ki ɗigini.” <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Nǝ Hilidus kumi nǝgu u, I' usu, “Yahaya u na patti ga taka u hilya ge' mil mushti!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Ti Hilidus nǝ gawasi illaki sǝ' gop Yahaya, is ki ndǝti as la'ti ge'lu kǝnndǝ'mbalǝn. Tǝ pǝllǝn gu gaki Hilidiya kǝli ki yelse wasi Philip, gunǝ' kanti ippalti ɗǝ kǝliwasi. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Tǝn gaki Yahaya ul Hilidus su, “A mbuni ki dǝm nǝ kǝliki yelse wagwai” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Tǝn gaki nǝgu Hilidiya ngap Yahaya a mbatldli, ti lyamti tǝ' tloti, ngo' nǝnǝgu tamaniwai gaki Hilidus. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Hilidus ɗǝ' ɓanti Yahaya, gaki ti mani Yahaya mulzo' mbatl kǝni mul pǝtl lǝɓa kizokini, I lakiɗa bǝ tiɗa za'ti ulǝn ti nda nǝtiwai. Hilidus in tikum shilǝn ki Yahaya u ɗǝ hwottiti, ngo nǝnǝgu ti ɓalɗǝ kupti ɗǝ shilǝn u, ti kup hwol mbatl nǝ kup ti. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Iki ipmbi shitu nǝ cin ki zǝ'ti mbǝ u, ip pǝli Gumsisi wasi nǝ bas mi'kina ki dlati ne' bas mbalǝn ki Galili daddaɓǝl. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Nǝ yakǝn ki hiludiya tete' dlom ɗǝ nyeptu, i mbuni Hilidus ne'sǝbǝlswasi. I Guu ul yakǝn kǝlisu, ngem ulnǝ ki lyamti u an bǝlki. <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />I Hilidus ndǝgiti nǝzal ulnǝ ka ngemi u an bǝlki, “Ko ti bwasti dlom ki guntikǝni.” <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Ippeki, in ngem dyawasi, “Yakǝn ta ngemi?” I dyani usu, “Gaki Yahaya mul pǝli' mbalǝn baptisma.” <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />A lǝbi alǝbi is susu' nǝ dleuti, ma' guu i' ultisu, “Ami lyamti nǝgun nǝguni ki bǝlǝn ga ki Yahaya mul pǝtl baptisma, age' gal ki pǝti.” <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />I mbatl ki guu lewi, Ngo nǝnǝgu gaki ta ultisuyi nǝzal akina ɗǝ sǝmbǝlswasi, tǝkǝn lyapti ti' ultisu zakiwai. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />A lǝbi i guu la' mul shinkǝn wasi, illaki sǝm mbǝl ga ki Yahaya. I mul shinkǝni le' kotl ga ki Yahaya teɗi a ge'lu zǝm mbalǝn. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Im mbǝl gami age' galpǝti, ib bǝl yakǝn kǝliyi, i yakǝn kǝliyi bǝl dyawasi. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Nǝ mil kushti ki Yahaya kum shilǝni u, is mbǝ is kan dli i, is guti.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />I mil shinkǝn ki Yesu is pal te' ma'ti, is dlimi' mus ulnǝs pǝli u, nǝ ulnǝs kulci u. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />I Yesu ulsisu nganni tǝn na' shu'ni ge' lu u nǝbǝ mbalǝn ɗa wai u, gaki mbalǝn diɗǝli si lǝti asi palti, mbi' dlil ɗǝ ɗamtima mil shinkǝn ki Yesu ma sambiwai. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Is zǝga ge' kundǝlǝn ki mali si nǝgwasǝn lu u nǝ bǝ mbalǝn ɗa wai u. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Iki mbalǝn diɓǝl, is yen zǝ'ga wasǝn, si mansi, mus mbalǝn kige gadli nǝ lǝbi u is dululu is ngǝtl nǝ mbǝkǝsti. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Nǝ pe'ti ki Yesu ɗige' kundǝlǝn ki malu, i'yen diɓǝl mbalǝn i' kum ci' gon twasǝn, gaki si kǝnǝ mbǝla u nǝbǝ mil be'lsi ɗawai u. I' go' kulcissi lǝɓa diɓǝli.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">I Yesu Bǝl Diɓǝl Mbalǝn Ulki ɗami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Nǝ cin ɓal nja tǝnda u i mil kushti wasi mbǝ ma'ti, is ultisu, “Lǝbisi ngu mbalǝn ɗawai, i ngu cin ɓal nja ti ndayi. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Za' mbalǝn nisi sǝ' zǝga tiya ge' gatlu nǝ nja aki u, sǝ' uli gawasǝn ulki ɗamiɗa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />I' ulsisu, “Kiniɓo bǝlǝnsi ulki ɗamiɗa” Is ul Yesu usu, “Ulki ɗamiwasǝn nǝ pǝtl bwasti dlom ki upki lii hwon nǝm kikyautǝn ki yakǝn mbalǝn, tǝn ullisi ulki ɗami ɗangwa?” <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />I Yesu ngemsi, “Ulki ɗami nǝmi nikini? Su' yanini.” Nǝs yani toɗu, is ultisu, “Lǝpa nantam kǝni, nǝ kes lob.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />I Yesu ul mil kushti wasi usu sǝ' bwas mbalǝn tiya as dǝm atli tiya tǝn di'me. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />I mbalǝn dǝm atli swai nami kutl kutl lǝbǝ kutl, nami kutl kutl lǝbǝ nantam. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />I Yesu kan lǝpa nantami nǝ kes gudǝl lopisi, it taki lya, i' gode Lya, i' caccal lǝpa i, ib bǝl mil kushti wasi sǝ' buwasi mbalǝn, is buwasisi kes lopi ɗaɗanu. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Muswasǝn is ɗami i kǝmsi. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />I mil kushti wasi yem dǝs kutl nǝ lop ki lǝpa gunǝ sa u nǝ kesi. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Diɓǝl ki mwani yi nǝ ɗami u sa tǝla zangu nantam.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɗǝ lǝ' tǝn mali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Nǝguni i Yesu la' mil kushti wasi sǝ' tege' kudǝlǝn ki mali sǝ' ngǝtl ti ɗǝ ɗakǝshti tiya Basaida, tiya ge'lu yiwon ki bal mal, i ul mbalǝn su sǝ' zǝga. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Nǝ' zasi u i totǝn zǝnga ɗǝ gyem Lya. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Nǝ gas pǝ'u, kudǝlǝni tiya dlom mali, Yesu tǝn bǝgasi nǝm nǝ gwasi. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Nǝ' en dǝl kudǝlǝn ɗǝ hwottisi u, tǝn gaki ndǝl ki yetǝl, adlom gasi i'go lǝ te'tǝnsi, a ti lǝ'tǝn mali. Ippǝli kǝnǝ tǝ' ɗakǝsh si, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Nǝs yen ti ɗǝ lǝ' tǝn malu, is yeni kǝnǝ nul kǝni, is la' yali. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Tǝn gaki kapuwasǝn i ɓa'gobsi nǝs yentu. I Yesu ɓulisi bi alǝbi, i' ulsisu, “Bǝ ɓanniwai amini.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Iki it tege' kudǝlǝn ne'si, i yetǝli muɗi. I gagashi' gob mil kushti wasi, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />gaki saman ulǝn tǝn lǝpa gunǝ bǝl mbalǝn zangu nantam is ɗamti ɗa uwai, gaki mbatldlowasǝn a kangǝli.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ndo'kǝl Mi'gonti a Jenisalata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Nǝs ɗakǝci, is mbǝci ge' atl ki Jenisalata, is kǝndǝ kudǝlǝni tǝn bigasi. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Nǝs pe' ɗige' kundǝlǝni u i mbalǝni mansi. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Is ngwal atlisi nǝ kitǝl, is go' ka' mi'go' tottǝn lumut si tala'si tiya ge'lu u nǝs kumi ti ɗa u. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Mus lu u nǝ Yesu lǝɗa u, bal gatli ko yakǝn gatli, as mbǝllic mi' gonti abi lu dobga, as ngemti sǝttin bi lulǝ gǝlwasma. Ginǝ tǝntu is ndoki.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Ulnǝ ɗǝ Bezǝ' yakǝn Mbalǝn u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Nǝ palisiyawa nǝ gyen mi' bǝtl lashti zhil ki Musa ginǝ mbǝ te' Ulshelima is domga ma' Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Is yeni na mil kushti wasi si ɗamti siɗa o'kǝl towai tǝngaki bǝtl lǝɓa ki mi' kina. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Palisiyawa ne' Yehudawa sǝn ɗa ɗamti pawai senǝ sa o'kǝl toh pa, gaki si bǝtl lǝɓa ki mi' kina. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />In sa pal te'ge'lu dobga ki ulti nǝ ulti taka u, sǝnɗa ɗamtipawai senǝ sa utisi mal takapa. Undǝ laɓa enɗa diɓǝli nǝsmbima' mi'kina wasǝn asi pǝlti, kǝnǝ ki o'kǝl gali ne' ki twom mali ne' kal ki dom. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />I palisiyawa ne' mi' kulci' mbalǝn zhil ki Musa is ngemti, “Ya lakiɗa mil kushti wagi siɗa bǝtl ulnǝs mbima mi'kina wasǝn u wai, si ɗamti bǝsiɗa o'kǝtl towai?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />I' ulsisu, “Bali Ishaya dlǝmi tǝnkini, mi' bǝna ki dwaɗǝn, kan u nǝ ɗa ki laci u:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“ ‘Mbalǝnyi agabi ki naltǝni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">mbadlwakǝn lolu nǝ ami.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Bǝtl Lya wasǝn u bali wai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">ge'shu ki zhil ki Lya, zhil ki mbalǝn kǝn si kulcissi.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Ka lakǝn zhil ki Lya taka i, ka ngapǝn zhil ki mi' kina i.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />I' ulsisu, “Kimanǝn shitu ki la'ti zhil ki Lya taka huti aki ngapti zhil ki mi' kina. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Gaki Musa usu, ‘Nal bwagi nǝ dyawagi,’ ‘Mulnǝ, abyal bwasu ko dyawasu, a tloti.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ngo nǝnǝgu kini ki usu, in mulnǝ azi ulǝn tǝngaki ti' ɗǝl bwasi nǝ dyawasi adǝm Kolban i', (iki, abǝl Lya i) <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />nǝgu katl, kǝkǝn za'titi tǝ'pǝli bwasi ko dyawasi kyautǝn ki ulǝnwai. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Nǝgu lakiɗa ki ɗa katshilǝn ki Lya baliwai gaki bǝtl zhil ki mi' kina. Ki njikǝ' pǝtl undigi.” <verse eid="MRK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Ɗaɗanu i Yesu taki diɓǝl mbalǝn bi, i' ulsisu, “Kumǝnnǝni muswakǝn, a'manangu. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Ulnǝ ɗǝ su' ge' yakǝn mbalǝn tu'dla u i ɗǝ bezǝtiwai, ulnǝ ɗǝ pe'tito' ge'tu ɗǝ bezǝti.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Mul kǝm ki kumti, ti' kumi, <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Kalki za'ti hwu'mbalǝn i, nǝtte libi u, i mil kushti wasi is ngemti yakǝn cimbǝlti u ɗǝ dlǝmti. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />I' ulsisu, “Kinima kimaniniwaiya?” “Ulnǝ ɗǝ suge' mbalǝn tu'dla u, kǝn bezǝtiwai, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Nǝbǝ ambadlwas kǝn suwai u, atu'ɗa'ka su, tu'nǝgu tǝpekki.” Nǝnǝgu Yesu pal mus ulki ɗami ki zeki. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />I' usu, “Ulnǝ ɗǝpe'ti to'ge' tu'ki yakǝn mbalǝn u iɗǝ bezǝt'ti. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />A tugi, age' mbadl ki yakǝn mbalǝn, kǝn bezǝn lǝɓa ɗǝpe'ti, kǝnǝ kwonti, nǝ mǝgǝlti, nǝ tlom mbalǝn, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />nǝ pǝti, nǝ lyap lǝɓa, nǝ ngashti, nǝ ship totugi, nǝ nge Lya, nǝ ndau bishitu, nǝ bezǝn dǝmti, nǝ nalkiga, nǝ kon nǝmbalǝn, nǝ ndokǝnti. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Mus bezǝn lǝɓagi atu'kǝn sipe'titoɗi, si ɗǝ bezǝn mbalǝn.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lati mbatl ki Kǝli Solopinikiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />I Yesu za'lǝbi illǝ Taya nǝ Sidon. It tege' libiwon, ta lyami tǝmulǝn maniwai ngo' nǝnǝgu a hwunwai. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Kǝliwon, gunǝ du mi'gatli gob yakuwasi, nǝkumi Yesu ɗa ki u, illǝ in ndakina ɗakka. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Kǝliyisi yakǝn Helinawa ni, atlki zǝtti iki Solopinikiya ni. In ngem Yesu tǝp pekkǝli yakuwasi du mi'gatl taka. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />I Yesu ultisu, “Hwe tǝkǝm mil pa, gaki a'mbuni akan ulki ɗami ki milwai tǝbǝl kaɗiwai.” <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />I kǝliyi ndǝgiti i'ultisu, “Mul nalti, ey nǝguɗa, ngo'nǝnǝgu kaɗi nǝnɗǝ ɗab bi ki mil.” <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />I Yesu ultisu, “Gaki shilǝnwa'gu, paltya, du mi'gatli aza' yakuwagi yakǝnkǝli.” <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Nǝ' paltya libi u ille'mbi yakuwasi kǝmuɗi tǝn lumutti, du mi'gatli apeki.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndokǝl mul nǝ bǝɗa kup kǝm nǝ ma'shilǝnwai u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />I Yesu za' lukǝ Taya, i' bǝli Sidon tǝn shitu i' bǝli Dikapolis illǝ dlilka ki Galili. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Is mbǝlli' mulnǝ bǝɗa kub kǝmwai u mul ɗǝɗɗǝtibi, is ngemti tǝszitto. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />I Yesu Kanti ispal malgǝni' ki hwu' mbalǝn, i Yesu shim mil toh age' kǝm ki mulisi, ibbeza makkǝn, ittǝn lǝgawasi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Illa'ga lya immbǝ mbadli, i'ultisu, “Ippata!” (Iki, “ɓuli!”) <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />I kǝmwas ɓuli, i lǝgawas laki, i'gob shilǝn. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />I Yesu dlimisi bǝs dlimi mulǝnwai. Sine se mbǝtl dlǝmtitǝnki siɗa. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Is kumgagashinti, is usu, “Tapǝl mus lǝɓa mbuni! Mulnǝ bǝ ɗa kubkǝmwai u ma ta kumi i, mul ɗǝɗɗǝti bima taman shilǝn I.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Ɗamti nǝ Mbalǝn ki Zangu Upsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mt 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Age cinisi i hwu' mbalǝn domga ɗaɗanu. Ulki ɗami nisi ɗawai, i Yesu imbe milkushti wasbi, i' ulsisu, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Ami kub go'kǝ' hwu mbalǝnyi, gaki asǝti mutti maki ngu asi ne'kǝni, ulki ɗami nisiɗawai. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />In a zasi sa zǝga libi nǝ kuzǝn u, sǝkǝn ma'mbǝkǝshti libiwai, i ngu nami pe'ni lolu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />I mil kushti wasi ndǝgiti is ultisu, “A ukǝn tǝ mbalǝn mbi ulki ɗami u nǝtǝ kǝm mbalǝn age'dǝlgǝn u?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />I Yesu ngemsi, “Lǝpa nǝmi nikini?” Is usu, “Ninngi.” <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />I' ul diɓǝl mbalǝnsu sǝ'dǝm atli. Nǝ'kan lǝpa ninngiyi, i' gode Lya ɗa, iccacali, i'go' bǝtl milkushti wasi sǝ' bwasi mbalǝn, is pǝli nugu. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Kwesen nisiɗa ten ngulen. Nǝ' gode Lya u, ippi milkushti wasi sǝ'bwasi mbalǝn. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />I mbalǝn ɗami i kǝmsi, i milkushti wasi yemi is njikǝn dǝs ninngi nǝgunǝ sa u. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Mbalǝnisi sa pǝl zangu upsi. Kal ki pallisibi, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />ittege' kundǝlǝn ne' mik kushti wasi, illǝge' luki Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Palisiyawa ɗǝ Lyap Ye'lwaɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />I palisiyawa gop ngep Yesu. Tǝn sǝ' cimbǝlti ɗa, is ngemti, tǝn gaki tǝn mbokisi toh tǝn lwaɗon sul lya. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />I Yesu mbǝ mbadli lolu, i'usu, “Ya lakiɗa kini mbalǝn kinǝgun ki ngep lwadɗa? Bali amipi' kini, kǝnbǝtlkin lwaɗon sul lyawai.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Iki is izza'si, ittege'kundǝlǝn ki mal, idɗakaci tiyatǝn bigasika.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yis Ki Palisiyawa Nǝki Hilidus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Imilkushti was musni sa kan bilediwai, lǝpa nǝm kǝn nisi katl ge'kundǝlǝni. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />I Yesu dǝllisi kǝm, i'ulsisu, “Yanǝn lu kizoki, apǝn ɗemɗem nǝ yiski palisiyawa nǝki Hilidus.” <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Is shilǝn ɗaɗɗasi, “Is usu tǝn gaki biledi niminɗawai.” <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu man ulnǝ si dlimti u, i Yesu ulsisu, “Ya lakiɗa iki usu biledi nikin ɗawai? Hal nǝguni ka manini uwaiya? Hal nǝgun kin ɗa yentiniwaiya? Mba dlwakǝn a ndǝdǝli kikǝn mantiniwaiya? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Dwaɗǝn nikinɗa bǝki enluwaiya nǝ kǝm nikinɗa bǝki kumtiwaiya? Kǝnɗa dabǝtl kiniwaiya? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Na chali mbalǝn zangu nantam lǝpa nantamu, mbutu nǝmi ki yemini ki bigeyi gunǝ sa u?” Is ultisu, “Kutl nǝ lop” <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />I Yesu ngemsi lǝpa ningi u na chali zangu upsi u pa? Mbutu nǝmi ki yemini? Is ultisu, “Ningi.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />I ulsisu, “Hal nǝgun ma, ka manini u waiya?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ndokǝl Dwawon a Batsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Is mbǝkǝci a Batsaida, i mbalǝn en mbǝlli' dwawon, is bǝlti bi tǝttǝnti. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />In ngapi dwanisi toh, it mbǝti malgǝn gatli. Ibbezze'makǝn a dwaɗǝn, izzǝ'toh, i Yesu ultisu, “Kǝn ɗǝ ye' ulunya?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />I dwani ya lulya, i'usu, “Ami yen mbalǝn; kǝnǝ pǝti asi duti” <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />I Yesu zǝ'toh tǝn dwaɗǝni ɗaɗanu. I dwanisi ɓul dwaɗǝn wasi, in ndoki, i'yen lu kizoki. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />I Yesu ultisu, “Paltya libi, bǝ tege' yakǝn gatluwai.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shilǝn Ki Bitlus Tǝn Yesu Tiki Almasihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />I Yesu ne' milkushtiwasi, is tege' mil gatlki Kaisaliya Pilibi. Tǝn shitu in ngemsi, “Ya mbalǝn ɗǝ mbetǝni?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Is ultisu, “Yahaya mulpǝtl baptisma; gyenne, Iliya; gyenne ɗaɗanu, si usu nǝm ge' mik nje'shinkǝn ki Lya kǝni.” <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />In ngemsi, “Kinipa yaki mbetǝni?” Bitlus ndǝgiti i'ultisu, “Kikǝ Almasihu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />I Yesu dǝlisi kǝm bǝs dlǝmi mulǝn ulǝn tǝntwai.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Dlǝm Undi Mǝshtu nǝ Tǝppǝli U</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />I'gop kulcissi, yakǝn mbalǝn nǝn tlebbǝna diɓǝli a ngeti, ma mikkina, ne' bas lǝɓasi, ne'mik bǝtl lashti zhil ki Musa, sǝn tloti, kalki mutti maki tǝn tlǝti lya ɗaɗanu. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />I Yesu dlǝmisi shilǝni kan unǝ sǝ'mani ɗa u. I Bitlus dǝlti malgǝni, i'gop matiti. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ngonǝnǝgu nǝ Yesu yalu kalu i'ya milkushtiwasi, im mati Bitlus i'ultisu, “Pǝlolu nǝ ami sheɗan! Ge mbatlwagi laɓa ki Lya ɗawai sai ki mbalǝn.” <verse eid="MRK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Imbe hwu mbalǝni bi ne'milkushtiwasi, i' ulsisu, “Mul lyab dǝp mul kushti ini, tǝnge' gawasi, a'kan gǝdlǝnnga ki bǝnawasi, abbǝlǝn kali. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Mul lyab gawasi, tǝnholti, mulnǝ a hol gawas gayi u, gaki shilǝn ki Lya u, ziti tiɗa. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Yakǝn ti yankǝn mbalǝn mbi intambi dǝb lǝɓa mus, ge shu ki gawasu? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Yakǝn ɗaɗanu ti yakǝn mbalǝn bǝli tǝn gaki ti'ul mbatlwas ɗa? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />In mulnǝ a kubsha i u nǝ shilǝn i u, age' hwon ki nge' ngapti ga nǝ pǝtl bezǝn lǝɓa, yakǝn mbalǝn ma tǝnkub shaki matti, inta mbǝ ge' natl ki mulzǝtti u ne' milshinkǝn ki Lya kizoki.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />I' ulsisu, “Bali bali ami dlǝmikini, genɗa ki dlǝli aki sǝkkǝn yen mǝshtwai, sai nǝ sayen gukki Lya a mbǝ nǝ ndǝlti.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shotti Ki Dli ki Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Kalki mutti mǝkka i Yesu kan Bitlus, nǝ Yakubu, nǝ Yahaya, sinǝ gwasǝn it tolsi tǝn pyasti zǝnga. I dliwas shoti. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />I lulǝgǝlwas hwali sol aɗi kaddwaɗǝn, kan u nǝbǝ mulǝn kǝn ma' pǝlti nǝgu tǝn dǝp lǝɓawai u. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />I Iliya nǝ Musa is pekkisi, a shilǝn ne' Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />I Bitlus ul Yesu su, “Mul lashti, a mbuni nǝmini ki u. Hwe tǝn pǝlǝn kǝs maki, gudǝl nǝm gwagi, nǝm ki Musa, nǝm ne ki Iliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />(Ta hwol ulnǝ tǝtl dlǝmi u yi, gaki sa kum ɓanti.) <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />I lyawon tlǝttoɗi i idlasi, i kum yalon ge'lyanisi, ti usu, “Guki yakuyini ki lyami. Kumǝnti.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Bǝnǝ mantiwasǝnwai sige nǝgu is yalu malgǝn ɗasi sayen mulǝnwai, Yesu ka'tl ne'si. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Sige' pe'ti suttǝn Zǝga, I Yesu pisi bǝs dlǝmi mulǝn ulnǝs yeni u wai, sai nǝ yakǝn mbalǝn a hilya ɗige' mi'mǝshti. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Is za'shilǝni ge' dlomwasǝn, asi shilǝn ne' yelsǝni yakǝnki “Hillya ge' mi' mǝshti.” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Is ngemti is ultisu, “Ya lakiɗa mi' bǝtl lashti zhil ki Musa ɗǝ ussu Iliya ki mulpatl su' pa?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />I' ulsisu, “Iliya ki mulpatl pa, appal mus lǝɓa. Imikǝnɗa ki laci tǝn yakǝn mbalǝn, tǝn tle'bǝna diɓǝli, as ngeti? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ami pikkini, Iliya a lǝge tambǝyi, sa pǝlit ulnǝ tǝmisiɗa u i, kan unǝ ɗa ki laci tǝntu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ndokǝl Yakǝn Mulmi'gatlǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Nǝs palte' ma' na mil kushti wasu, is yen hwu mbalǝn aga ndǝlsi i, mi' bǝtl lashti zhil ki Musa ɗǝ shottibi ne'si. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Nǝ ye' Yesu, mus hwu mbalǝnyi is kum gagashinti, is lǝtemma'ti nǝkitǝl, sǝ' shinnitti. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />In ngemsi, “Shoti bi kiyakǝn kiniɗa ne'si?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />I gudǝl nǝm ge'mbalǝni ndǝgiti, i'ultisu, “Mul lashti, i ngu, a mbǝlli' yakuyini, gunǝ mi'gatli ki nge' shilǝn nidɗa. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Nǝta totǝntu, sai nǝ tala'ti atli, a biwas ɗǝpǝ't pukǝtkǝt, a ti ashti shinwasi, ati pǝ'sanganga. Adlimi milkushti wagiyi sǝppe'kǝlti, sa maniwai.” <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />I Yesu ndǝgisi i'ulsisu, “Kini mbalǝn ki nǝgun u nǝbǝ kiɗa la'ti mbadlwai u! Anǝmi taman dǝp ne'kini? Anǝmi taman ngashtibi nǝkini? Mbǝlli nǝn yakǝni.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Is mbǝlli' yakǝni. Nǝ mi'gatli yen Yesu u, alǝbi alǝbi i mi'gatli bat yakǝni, i dliwas gon nyepti, in nda atli i'go' bǝdǝlti, a biwas ɗǝ pǝt pukǝtkǝt. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu ngem mul zǝ'yakǝni, “Kǝnǝ anǝmi uli mbitu?” I bwasisi usu, “Adɗi na' yakǝn. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Ta tle la'titi ge' utu ko mali, gaki tǝ'tlotiɗa. Ngo nǝnǝgu kǝn ma'pǝl ulǝn u, kum gontinǝn a ɗǝlmi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />“ ‘In kǝn manti u?’ ” I Yesu ultisu, “Mus lǝɓa mul pǝ'kǝni ma'mul la'ti mbadlǝ.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Alǝbi alǝbi i bwas ki yakǝni usu “A la' mbadlǝ. Kati lǝshi la'ti mbadlǝ taka!” <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Nǝ Yesu yen hwu mbalǝn ɗǝ kitǝl teɗu, im mati du mi'gatli i'ultisu, “Ki, mi'gatlu mul nge' kup kǝm nǝ shilǝn u, a piki bwaski kiti, bǝ tege'ti nǝwai.” <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Kalki la'ti yalki mi'gatli, illi'ti nǝ ndǝlti, dlǝwas ɗǝ nepti, ibbwasti nǝti. I yakǝni palkǝni hwum mbalǝn, i ge' mbalǝn kilǝbi diɓǝli nami usu, “Tamǝcci” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />I Yesu gobto wasi it tlǝlti lya, i' hilya gal. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />I Yesu telibi u i mil kushtiwas ungemti a malgǝni is ultisu, “Ya lakiɗa ma man pekkǝltiwai?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />I Yesu ulsisu, “Undiyi nǝnɗa pe'twai sainǝ ngeb lya.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a Dlim Undi Mǝshtu Nǝtǝ'pǝli u Ɗaɗanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Is hilya ɗilǝbi, is ɓeu tiya Galili, Yesu alyami tǝ mullǝn maniwai, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />gaki ti kulci' mil kushtiwasi, ti ulsisu, “Sǝnbǝl yakǝn mbalǝn ma'mbalǝn, sin tlotti, in sa tlotu kuma, kalki mutti maki tǝn tlǝti lya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Sine saman shilǝnǝwai, si ɓanti'ngepti.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wokǝn Ngǝli nǝ Nalti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Is mbǝ kapalnahum. Nǝ'te'libi u in ngemsi, “Yaki dlimtin tǝn shitu?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ama sa shilǝnwai, gaki tǝn shitu sa shilǝn i tǝn okǝnki baliwasǝn. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Iddǝm atli, imbe milkushti was kutl nǝ lopi bi, i'ulsisu, “Mulnǝ ɗǝ lyamti tǝt dǝm mulkina u, tikǝ mul dǝb yakǝni, addǝm zheli ki mbalǝn.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />I'kan na'yakuwon, izziti adlom ɗasi, illuti adli, i'ul sisu, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Mulnǝ a nje na'yakǝn kǝnǝ gu u gaki shin i u, ami tǝ njeni. Mulnǝ nje u, ami tǝh njewai, mulnǝ shinǝn suɗuh tǝ njeti.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulnǝ ɗa gemmini wai u, ginǝn kǝnǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />I Yahaya ultisu, “Mul lashti, miyen mulǝn ɗǝ pekkǝtl mi'gatli nǝ shin wagi, in ultisu tǝs zaki, gaki tiɗa bǝlmi kalwai.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />I Yesu usu, bi hane twai. Mulǝn kǝn pǝl gagashiti nǝ shinyini, apa alǝbi alǝbi abbyalǝnwai. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Mulnǝ bǝ ɗa leu badl nǝmini wai u, ginǝn kǝni. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Mulnǝ abǝlkin mbǝga mal nǝm gaki kini ki Almasihu u, bali ami pikkini, tǝkǝn hol ulnǝ sǝbbǝltwai.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shitu ki pǝl Bezǝn Ulǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Nǝtǝ mulnǝn la'gon ge'na'mili mi'la'ti mbatl nǝ ami tǝppǝl bes lǝɓa, nǝn ngǝtlitti sǝllaki'bal yegǝn nǝ'ti hwu a yalɗakka, a la'ti swage'bal mali. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />In towa'ɗǝ la'tiki ɗǝpǝl beslǝɓa u, a pocitaka. Nǝn ngǝtli' ki, ki tege' gukki lya nǝ ndola toh, ɗǝ gunǝ ki' tege' utu nǝ toh lopu, utuyi mul pǝshtiwai. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />[Alǝbi zhiɓǝl mi'cissi nǝnɗa mǝshtwai, nǝnɗa mbǝshti utuyiwai.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />In asǝnwa' ɗǝ la'tiki ɗǝ pǝl beslǝɓa u, a pocitaka. Nǝn ngǝtli' ki, ki' tege'gu'ki Lya nǝ ndola asǝn, nǝ sǝllaki ge' ban utu nǝ asǝn lop. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />[Alǝbi zhiɓǝl mi'cissi nǝnɗa mǝshtwai, nǝnɗa mbǝshti utuyiwai.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />In dwaɗǝn wa'ɗǝ la'tiki ɗǝ pǝl beslǝɓa u, a ngongoli taka. Nǝn ngǝtlikki ki'tege' gukki Lya nǝ dwaɗǝn nǝm, nǝtǝ' laki age'ban utu nǝ dwaɗǝ lop. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Alǝbi zhiɓil mi'cissi nǝnɗa mǝshtwai, nǝnɗa mbǝshti utuyiwai. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Nǝ utu sǝ'okkǝl mbalǝn, kan unǝ ɗǝ okkǝl lǝɓa nǝ kukkudu u. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Kukkudu ulki zekkini, in kukkudu i a hammu, nǝ yakǝn tǝ mbili' tǝptǝnki? A' dǝmni nǝ kukkudu ge' mba dlwakǝn. Pǝlǝn dǝbki zeki ne'yelsǝni.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Kushti ki Yesu tǝn Bwasti kutletti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mt 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />I Yesu hilya ɗǝlǝbi, illǝ ge' Atl ki Yehudiya, ne' tǝn bigasi ki dlǝlka Uldun. I hwu' mbalǝn maga ma'ti ɗaɗanu, i'kulcisi kan u nǝ'kuɗa u. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />I palisiyawayen mbǝ ma'ti gaki sǝccimbǝlti, is ngemti is ultisu, “Kizoɗa tǝ yakǝn mbalǝn la' kǝli wasa?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Inndǝgisi i'usu, “Ya Musa pikini?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Is usu, “Musa bǝl mbalǝn sǝllash lwabbatki tlot kutleti, ala kǝliyisi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu ulsisu, “Gaki ndǝlki gawakǝn lakiɗa i Musa lacikin zhiluɗa. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Amma teɗi ‘Lya kǝnǝnsi, mwani nǝ kǝli. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Gaki nǝgu a mulǝn za'dyawasi nǝ bwasi, an ngap kǝliwasi.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Nǝguni si lopi as dǝm dlinǝm. Akinaki nǝmkǝni sǝkǝn dǝmti dli lopkǝnwai. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Ulnǝ Lya a mani u, bǝ mbalǝn bwasiwai.” <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />A gip libine i milkushtiwas ngemti ɗaɗanu tǝn shilǝngu. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />I' ulsisu, “Mulnǝ ala kǝliwasu, in ngau kundu u, ko'kǝn ti pǝlti nǝki lopi. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />In kǝliyi ala mwani wasu in ngau kundu u, tapǝl kontu ɓalu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alaki mil Albalka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mt 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Mbalǝn ɗǝ mbǝllit Yesu na' mil gaki tǝttǝnsiɗa, i milkushtiwas matisi. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Nǝ Yesu yeni nǝgu u i uli cillo'si. I' ulsisu “Zakǝn na'mil sǝmmbǝ makkǝni, bi hanesiwai. Gu'ki Lya ki unduwasǝnkǝni. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Ami dlǝmikkini, mus mulnǝ andǝ nǝ gukki Lya kǝnǝ gunǝ na yakǝn ɗǝpǝlti wai u, tǝkǝn teti ge'guntiwai.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />I Yesu kansi twadli, ati zissito, ati laki'si albalka.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakǝn giɗǝnsi mul usǝn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mt 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Nǝ Yesu gollǝtu, i mulǝn pe'tetnǝkitǝl, inngus kinaɗakka, in ngemti i'ultisu, “Mullashti mul zo'mbadlǝ, yakǝntapǝli tambi dlǝwu nǝbǝ kǝnpa'twai u?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />I Yesu ultisu, “Yalakiɗa i'mbeki zo'mbadlǝ? Mul zo'mbatl nǝnɗawai sai Lya nǝgwasi. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Man zhilgi, ‘bǝtlo mbalǝnwai. Bǝ pǝl kontwai. Bǝ mǝgǝlwai, bǝdlǝm laga' tǝn mulǝnwai, bǝ dlu mbalǝnwai. Nal mikzǝ'ki.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />I'ultisu, “Mullashti, mus apǝl undigi a ami na yakǝn.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />I Yesu yati ya'ki lyamti, i'ultisu, “Ul nǝmkǝn ɓaliki lǝ ki'ul ulnǝ ni'zi u taka, a'bǝl mingi nǝbǝ ulǝn nisi ɗawai u, kǝn mbi lǝɓa a Lya. Apa a'mbǝ a'bǝlǝnkal.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Nǝ kub shilǝni i kinawasnda, izzǝga ati du mbadlǝ, gaki usǝn nǝdɗa eye. <verse eid="MRK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />A lǝbi I Yesu ya milkushtiwasi, i'ulsisu, “Nǝn lotiɗa tǝmi' usǝn tege'gu'ki Lya!” <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Milkushti yi kum gagashit ki shilǝnwasi. I Yesu ulsisu ɗaɗanu, “Kini milini, nǝn lotiɗa te'ge guki Lya! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Nǝte'kǝ mul usǝn ge'guki Lya, nǝn ngǝtlǝ' tǝ lakumi tǝbɓeu ge'shuki allula.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Is kum gagashit mulndǝlti, is ultisu, “In nǝgu uɓo, wokǝn mbi pekkǝlkǝn ngu?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />I Yesu yasi, i'usu, “Ma'mbalǝnɓo mulpǝkkǝnwai, ama bǝ ma'Lya wai. Gaki muslǝɓa mulpǝkǝni ma' Lya.” <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />I Bitlus ultisu, “Mi ngu ma za'lǝɓayi mabǝlkikali.” <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu usu, “Bali ami dlǝmi'kini, mulǝn kǝn za'ti libi, ko yelsǝniwas mudlǝ, ko yelsǝniwas mwani, ko dyawasi, ko bwasi, ko milwasi, ko guwasi, gayini nǝkuma shilǝnki Lya, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />apa a'hwol mbi' diɓǝl lǝɓa kutlkutl lǝbi kutl ge' dǝpki nǝguni, nǝ libi, nǝ yelsǝni mudlǝ, nǝ yelsǝni mwani, ne' mi'zǝtti mudlǝ, ne'mil, ne'guh, i ngu kuma nǝ bǝna. A lahila ne, ammbi dliwunǝbǝ kǝn pa'twai u. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Diɓǝli kǝkina nǝnpaltikali, kikali nǝnpalti kina.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a Dlim Undi Mǝshtu nǝ Tǝppǝli u Ɗaɗanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mt 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Lk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Si to'ulshelima, Yesu ɗǝ lǝ'akinaɗasi, a milkushtiwas ɗǝ kup gagashinti, mbalǝnyi nǝ ɗǝ bǝdl si kalu sima asi kupɓanti. Im mbǝ' kutl nǝ lopiy, amalgǝni i'go'dlimissi ulnǝ tǝ mbitu. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />I' usu, “I ngu mi sutin Ulshelima, sǝn bǝdl yakǝnmbalǝn ma'bas lǝɓasi ki Lya ne'mi'lashti zhil ki Musa, sin pocitti shilǝnki mǝshti, as bǝl mingi nǝbǝs man Lya wai u. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Sin lakkitti bi, as bezze'makǝn, as li'ti, as tloti, kalki mutti maki kuma atli lya.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngepki Yakubu nǝ Yahaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mt 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Yakubu nǝ Yahaya, milki Zabadi, is sha'temma'ti, is ultisu, “Mullashti, mingepki ki pǝlimi ulǝn.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />I ulsisu, “Yaki lyamtini ta pǝlikini?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Is ultisu, “Ndǝgimi, cinkǝ te'ge' naltwagi, tǝ nǝm dǝm tǝn toshimtwagi, nǝm tǝn tonawagi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />I Yesu ulsisu, “Kimanǝn ulnǝ ngemtini uwai. Kǝn ma'tleti ge'mbǝga malunǝtta tlewa? Ko nǝn ma'pǝlikkin baptisma unǝssǝ' pǝlitǝnwa?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Is ultisu, “Mǝn manti.” I Yesu ulsisu, “Mbǝgamalunǝ tatle nǝnali u, nǝnali ki tleni, baptisma u nǝsǝ'pǝli u, nǝnali sǝppǝli kini. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Ama dǝptǝn toh shimtini, ko tǝn tohna yini, gikǝnwai gunǝ nǝ halta bǝli u. Ai, kǝginǝs pǝli gawasǝn uni.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Nǝ milkushtiwas kutli kumi nǝgu u, is gob kub dutu'ki Yakubu nǝ Yahaya. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />I Yesu takisibi i'ulsisu, “Ki manini ginǝ mansi nǝ bǝ Yahudawawai u gumsisi wasǝn sǝnɗǝ nu ne' mbalǝnwasǝn kǝmti sǝnɗǝ pǝlisi ndǝlti. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Kǝndǝmti nǝgu ge' dlomwakǝnwai, amma mulnǝ ɗǝ lyamti tǝ'dǝm bali age' kini u, sainǝ tadǝm zheli wakǝn. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Mulnǝ ɗǝlyab dǝb mulkina wakǝn u, sainǝ tadǝm zheli ki kowonngi. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Gaki yakǝn mbalǝn ma tǝ mbǝni sǝppǝli'bǝna ɗawai, gaki tima tǝppǝl bǝnaɗani, abbǝl dlǝwasi gaki diɓǝl mbalǝn.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ndokǝl Baltimawus Dwa u</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mt 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Is mbǝkǝci a Yaliko. Ti pe'ti ɗǝ Yaliko ngu, nǝti ne'mikkushtiwasi, nǝ bal dwobgakǝ diɓǝl mbalǝn, i dwa won mul ngeplu shinwasi Baltimawus, yakǝnki Timawus, tiki dǝmi a bishitu. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Nǝkkumi Yesu mul Nazalat kǝn u, i'go' tlǝl yali ati usu, “Yesu yakǝnki Dauda, kum gontini!” <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />I diɓǝl mbalǝn matiti, tǝn bǝshilǝnnuwai. Amma i'gob mbǝtl tlǝl yaltinki, ti usu, “yakǝnki Dauda kum gontini!” <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />I Yesu dlili i'usu, “Takitibi teh.” Is taki dwanisi bi teɗi is ultisu, “Albishiliwagi! Leteɗi, ti mbekkibi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Illa' ul idlatti taka, ittlǝtyama' Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />I Yesu ultisu, “Yaki lyamti ta pǝliki?” Idwani ultisu, “mullashti, tambi yellu!” <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />I Yesu ultisu, “Zǝgawagi, la'ti mbalwa' a ndokǝlki.” Alǝbi i'ellu, ibbǝl Yesu kal izzǝga.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu te' Ulshelima Ge'shu ki Gunti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Nǝs ɓalnja' nǝ Ulshelima u nǝ Betapaji, nǝ Betanya, a ma' Zǝnga Ki zaitun, i' Yesu shin mil kushtiwasi lob, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />I Yesu ulsisu, “Tenge' yakǝn gatlu nǝ kina wakǝn u, Nǝte' twakǝn kǝn en' yakǝn zhaki ki kǝndi, gunǝ bǝmulǝn a to tǝnti gason wai u. A' tǝgǝlǝn ti suɗi. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />In mulǝn a ulkinsu, ‘Ya kipǝlin ɗa nǝgu?’ A ulǝnsisu ‘Mulban kǝn ɗǝ lyapti, tǝn patltisut nǝguni.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Is zǝga, is le'mbi yakǝn zhaki a kina dlabi a bishitu, is tǝngǝlti. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Mɓalǝn inǝ ki dlǝli a lǝbi u, is ulsisu, “Ya laki ki tǝngǝtl yakǝn zhaki u ɗa?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Is dlǝmisi ulnǝ Yesu pisi u. I mbalǝnni za'si is zǝga, <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Nǝs mbǝlli Yesu yakǝn zhaki u, is lala lulutwasǝn tǝnti, it toh tǝnti. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />I' hwu' mbalǝn lala lulutwasǝn tǝn shitu i'nami caldwa te' ge' dǝlgǝn i gen' dizhan dwai nǝscali te'ge' dǝlgǝni u. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Mi' ki kina nǝ mi' bǝtl kalwasi asi tlǝl yali asi ussu, “Hosanna! Albalka tǝn mul mbǝ ge' shin ki Lya! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Albalka ki gut mul mbǝti, ki bwasinǝn Dauda! Hosanna ki Lya!” <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />I Yesu te' Ulshelima, i' te'ge libi ki Lya. Nǝ yaya lutya u nǝ' enlu a gemtu, ippeki illǝ Betǝnya nǝ kult nǝ loppi.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">I Yesu Pǝli Pǝ' ki Kah bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Cilkǝlu nǝ za'ti betanya wasǝn, a Yesu ɗǝ kum kuzǝn. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Nǝ' en pǝkkǝ kah tel lolu u mul dwa lede, Nǝllǝ' ya ni u tambi mil tǝnkiwai. Nǝm mbǝci ma'tu, tambi ulǝn tǝnkiwai amma dwakatl, gaki luɓal kǝpǝtl mil ki kah u wai. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />I ul kah nisisu, “Bǝmulǝn ɗam mil lwanǝwai hal patwagi!” Amilkushtiwas ɗǝ kubti.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Likǝn Libi ki Lya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Is mbǝci Ulshelima, I Yesu tye ge' libi ki Lya i'gop katti mil ultitaka alǝbi, i'dǝzhanisi kundǝn ki ulpwasǝn taka, ne' mil shotti ulpi, ne'mil utl balutaka, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Taza'si sǝllǝ ge' libi ki Lya nǝ ulǝn nǝwai, <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Ippisi shilǝn, i ulsisu, “Kilaciɗa: ‘Libi ini nǝndemti libi shilǝn ki Lya ki mi' dǝplǝɓa’ ki ni ɓo ka palliniyi lu dǝpki mǝgǝlsi.” <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Nǝbas lǝɓasi nemi' lashti zhil ki Musa nǝskumshilǝni u is gop ngau shitu kigoptiti sǝ'tloti, gaki mbalǝn diɓǝli sikupɓultwasi, mus dopga ki mbalǝn si kup gagashit ki kushtiwasi. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Nǝ su' pǝ u Yesu ne' milkushtiwasi is pe' ɗǝ ge'gadli.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shilǝn Tǝn Ko'Kǝn Pǝ' ki kah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Nǝkyau si ɓeuti, is ye'kah nǝsi akokkǝnyi hal nǝ tlilgisi, <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Bitlus dambǝlti i' ul Yesu su, “Mullashti, nǝya! Kah u nǝ' pǝlibbi u. Akokkǝn i!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />I Yesu ndǝgi. I' ulsisu, “Lakǝn mbadli tǝn Lya” <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />“Bali a mipi'kini, in mulnǝ a ndǝ nǝ Lya u, tǝn ma' utl calgatl usu, ‘Ndus ɗǝki nda swa ge' dlǝlka u’ abǝ ta bwas mba dlwa swai u nǝn pǝlitti ulisi. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Gaki nǝgu a mi pikkini ulnǝ ka gyemin ge' shilǝn nǝ Lya u, i' ndǝ nǝ nali u, kǝm mbitini. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Kogassi u kǝn kidlǝlni ɗǝ gyep Lya u, in ka ngapǝn mullǝn mbatlu, a tusintaka, Gaki bwaswakǝn ki lya ma tǝn tusi'kin bezǝn lǝɓawakǝn taka. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Inkiɗa tusti mulnǝ ngapǝnti mbatl takawai u bwaswakǝn ki lya ma tikǝn ndusi'kin ulnǝ ki pǝliti u takawai.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngemti tǝn Ndǝtl ki Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Nǝspalswa Ulshelima u, ti dut tyagelu libi ki Lya, i Lǝɓasi ne'mi'bǝl lashti zhil ki Musa, nǝ mi'kina ki mbalǝn is mbǝ ma'ti, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Is ul Yesu su, “Nǝ shitu u kǝn kipǝl usiɗa u? Wokǝn bǝlkishitu kǝpǝlti nǝgu?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu i' ulsisu, “Ta pǝllikin undi gyepton. A ndǝgi nǝni, amine adlǝmi'kini nǝ ndǝtl ki okǝn amipǝl usi ɗa. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Baptisma ki Yahaya sul lya, kǝnpeka koki mbalǝn kǝni? Dlǝminǝni!” <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Is gob shottibi ne' elsǝni asi usu, “In ma ulnǝsu, ‘Sul lya kǝn pe'ku’ tǝn ulminsu ‘Ya lakiɗa bǝma ndǝ ninǝti ɗawai?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ngo nǝnǝgu sa ussu, ‘Ki mbalǝn kǝn u’ ” (Siɓulti' hwu'mbalǝn, nǝ kowongi simani Yahaya mul nje shinkǝ ki Lya kǝni.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Is ndǝgi' Yesu, “Simani wai.” I Yesu usu, “Akǝn pi'kini nǝ ndǝltu kǝn amipǝl usi ɗawai.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Cibǝlti tǝn mi'ka' gu ki inabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesu pǝlisi shilǝn nǝ cibǝlti, i ulsisu, “Mullǝn ɗa mulnǝ pǝl gu inabi. I' gandǝli, i' ɗushu ki cetti mill inabi isi. I' kǝn yakǝn kǝs ki mul ɓutti gu. Ip bǝl mbalǝn yen mi' kwolu kǝ lǝbi. Ilǝge Atliwon. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Nǝgis cilu, i shin zheliwasi ma mi' kwolu i tǝ'kami' na mil inabi i te'ɗi. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ngo nǝnǝgu mi'kwolluyi is gobti, is liti is katti tohwas koni. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />I' shin zheli won' ɗanu ma'si; is li'muli aga, is lati ge'sha. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />I' shin gon'ɗanu, tiɓo, is tloti. I shin gen ɗanu diɓǝli; genwasǝn gen'ɓo is tlosi, genwasǝn ge'si ɓo is li'si. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Hal nǝgunma Yakǝn, nǝm ɗiti. Gunǝ ti lyapti u. Ibpa' shi' yakǝni swamasi, i' usu, ‘nǝgon as yen naltwasi.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ngo nǝnǝgu mi'kollu i ma is ul elsǝsu ‘Yakuwas kǝngu, mulgu tiɗǝ nje' bwasi nganni, Mi tloti, alǝɓayi dǝmginǝn.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Is gobti is tloti, is latitaka tyakalbi. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yakǝn tǝ mulgu i pǝli? Tǝn mbǝti a tlwami' kwollu i si, ab bǝlmbalǝn yen gu isi. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Kiniɓo ka yanǝn shilǝn ki Lya ki laci gasonwaiya? Ki laci ɗa ɗǝ ussu, ‘Zǝnga u nǝ mi' kǝbbi nge u, i dǝm zǝnga gǝsbi ki ze'ki. <verse eid="MRK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Gu kyautǝn ki Lya kǝni, ma'mini ulki gagashi'kǝni.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Bal lǝɓa, nǝ mi' bǝtl lashti zhil ki Musa ne' mi'kina is ngau shitu ki gobtiti, simani cimɓǝlti u tǝnsi ni, is kum ɓulti ki hwu mbalǝn. Gaki nǝgu is zati, is ziga wasǝn.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngepti tǝn Ɓǝtl up Ki ban ki Kaisal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Is shin palisiyawa yentey nǝ mbalǝn ki Hilidus, gaki si hwodǝl Yesu geshilǝ wasi. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Nǝs mbǝ u, is ultisu, “Mul, lashti mimani ki mul dlǝb balini, kiɗa olt mbalǝn wai, i' kan kowonngi ndatce, sai kullcit mbalǝn shitu ki Lya kǝnkiɗa. A ndalini ki tǝnɓalt upki banya, ki Kaisalya bal gu ki Loma, ko imi? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Tǝm ɓatliya kobǝn ɓatliwai?” Ti'ma nǝm mangashtwasǝn u nǝsikǝn ndǝtti u, I'ulsisu, “Yalaki i ki cimbǝltǝn ɗa? Nǝ kaminǝn ulpu te'ɗi tanǝyani.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Is kamiktai. I ulsisu, “Shin ki wokǝni nǝ shishipti ki wokǝntǝnki? Is ultisu, ki Kaisalkǝni.” <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />I Yesu ulsisu, “Bǝlǝn Kaisal, ulnǝ ki Kaisal u, a'bǝlǝn Lya ulnǝ ki Lya u.” Is kum gagashinti ki Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngep tǝn Hillya Ki mi' Mǝshti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Sadukiyawa, si ussu, tlǝllya ki mi' mǝshtiɗawai, is mbǝ ma ti, nǝ gyemti, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Mul lashti” is usu, “Musa alacimi, ǝn yelse ki mulǝn amǝcu, isza kǝliwasi bǝ yakǝn ni'ɗawai u, adǝmi hwel ki kan kǝlisi, azi yelse wagisi mil. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Is, pǝl mbalǝnyen elsǝni ini mwani gudǝl ninngi. Nǝm pǝl kutleti, immǝci taza yakǝnwai. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Kilopisi ma i kǝnkǝli i, tima immǝci, tambi Yakǝn sitwai. Ki maki ma nǝgu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Nǝgu must ningi i sambi yakǝn ne'twai. Patibisi ikǝli i mǝci. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Gas, tlǝllya kǝmik mashti, kǝli kǝwo kǝntidǝmi age' si? Gaki muswasǝn sadǝm nǝkǝli isi i.” <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />I Yesu ulsisu, “Gaki nǝgu ki gǝlni ɗawaiwa? Gaki kimanǝn lwabatwai, bǝmanǝn pǝlti ki Lya wai. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Gas tlǝllya kǝmik mǝshti kuletti nǝn ɗawai, abǝkǝndǝti nǝn ɗawai, sitdǝm kǝnǝ milshinkǝn ki Lya kǝni. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Gaki tlǝl lya kimi mǝshti, kataɓa, dlap lashti ki lwabakki musa waiya, kǝnǝgunǝ Lya ultisu, ‘Ami ki Lya ki Iblahim, nǝ Ishaku nǝ Yakubu waiya?’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Gi'nǝ Lya wasǝn bǝ mul mushtiwai u, Lya wasǝn kamini. Balini kagǝlni i.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zhil mul Nalti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />I mul bǝl lashti won ki Musa immbǝ immbisi ɗǝ shotti bi ne yelsǝni. Nǝ' en Yesu apǝlisi shilǝn ki zeki u in gyem Yesu, “Zhilu kǝnki mul natl kǝni?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />I Yesu ndǝgiti i ultisu “Mul nalti tikǝ, ‘Kumini mi' Islaila, Lya i nǝn, Lya nǝmkǝni. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Lyam Lya wagi nǝ mbadlwagi, nǝ dliwagi, nǝmanti wagi, nǝ ndǝl twagi.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Mul bǝtlti iki, ‘ki Lyam yelsewagi kǝnǝ gawagi.’ Zho ulǝn nǝnɗa ti ngǝtl gu nǝnaltwai.” <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />I' mul lashti zhil ki Musa i ultisu, “A ndǝgi balini mul lashti, Lya nǝm kǝni, gonnǝn ɗawai saiti, <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />A' lyam Lya nǝ mus mbatlwagi, nǝ mus mantiwagi, nǝ mus ndǝltwagi, a' lyam yel'sewagi kǝnǝ gawagi, Ai ngǝtl ulnǝ ki kyeli Lya u nǝ poshti poshti u nǝ kini ɗa u lolu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Nǝ Yesu Ye'ni tapǝlli shilǝn ki zeki u, I ultisu, “Kiɗa lolu nǝ gu'ki Lya wai.” Pa'ti bisi mulǝn a ngemti nǝ ndǝl ki mbatl ki ullǝn nuwai.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyep tǝn Ya'kǝn ki Dauda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Nǝ Yesu ɗǝ, kulcik mbalǝn age libi ki Lya i' usu, “Yalaki i mi' lashti zhil ki Musa usu almasihu yakǝnkǝ Dauda ni? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Dauda gawasi, tǝn ndǝl ki yalki mbatl ki Lya ki gunti I usu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“ ‘Lya ul Lya i usu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">“Dǝm tǝn toh shimtini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">he nǝ azǝkki a ga ɗǝ mik ngekki.” ’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Dauda gawasi immɓe' ki ‘Lya.’ Yala'ti atdǝm yakuwasɗa?” Hwu mbalǝn is ga'ki' kǝm nǝ holtugi.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ɓuli mi' Lashti Zhil ki Musa Galɗǝga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />A ge'lu kulcik mbalǝn ki Yesu, i' usu, “Pǝn ɗemɗem nǝmi bǝtl lashti zhil ki Musa, mi' lyap dunnǝ bas lulugǝl, lyamtiwasǝn tǝ mbalǝn gob shinnissi age'lu ulti nǝ ultitaka, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />lyamtiwasǝn tǝ mbalǝn bǝtlsi ludǝp kizeki age'lu dopga ki Yahudawa, nǝlu daddabǝl. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Siki mi'ɗap lǝɓa ki mudliyi nǝ mwani mǝcisi u, nǝ pǝtl pyasi' shilǝn nǝ Lya gaki gǝl assan. Sisǝ' pocisi batlti mulndǝlti.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bǝtl up Ki kǝli u nǝ Mwani Mǝcitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />I Yesu dǝm malgun kǝlu kap up ki libi ki Lya, ati ya' ulpu nǝsi uttti agibɓi u. Hwu mbalǝn mik ulki toh asi utti ulpi milnalti. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Amma guli kǝliwonmbǝ gunǝ bǝ ullǝn nǝɗawai u gunǝ mwaniwas mǝci i bǝl bwasti dlom ki kobo, iki kobo nǝm, <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />I Yesu taki milkushtiwas bi, i ulsisu, “Balini, amipikkini, ulnǝ guli u utti u gunǝ bǝ ulǝn nǝɗa wai u ngǝl ki mbalǝn kap. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Musswasǝn si bǝlini tǝngaki usǝn wasǝn, ti ɓo jwa ulnǝ nǝtoh u tǝbǝli, gunǝ itidǝmiti.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Dlǝm undi Batti Libi ki Lya u nǝ tǝ pǝldli u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu ɗǝpeti tet libi ki Lya, nǝm age'mil kushtiwasi i ultisu, “Mullashti, nǝyen undi zǝnga i nǝ kǝpbi i!” <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />I Yesu ultisu, “Kǝn ɗǝye' unndibas kǝpbi iwa?” Ba zǝnga u nǝ bǝkǝn dizhatti takawai u. <verse eid="MRK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu kǝdǝmi atǝn zǝga Zaitun gunǝ ɗǝ ya' libi ki Lya u iki Bitlus, nǝ Yakubu, nǝ Yahaya, nǝ Andalawas is gyemti amalgǝni <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Dlǝmimi anǝmi sǝppǝl usi u? Undi ulu kǝntǝn yeni gasi u nǝɗǝ lyap ndatu?” <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />I Yesu ulsisu, “Maninca bǝ mulǝn gǝl kiniwai. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Mbalǝn diɓǝli sǝn bǝti ge' shin ini, asi ussu ‘Siki ami,’ hal Sǝngǝl mbalǝn diɓǝli. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Inki kup shilǝn ki dlati dlati nǝ kumini kumini wasǝn u bǝ ɓatlwakǝn tlǝwai. Hwel nǝgu tǝnda, amma pati bisi i' ɓalla u wai. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Mɓalǝn nǝntli yelsǝni mbalǝn, gunti, nǝntli gunti. Nǝngotti kup nyapti ki atli agǝ luyen, nǝ kuzǝn. Ngo nǝnǝgu la'ti gǝs ki bǝnani.”<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Pǝn ɗemɗem nǝ gawakǝn, gakisǝn tilakin kina ɗǝ mik atli, as likin age lu dopga ki Yahudawa. Gaki shin ini, kin dliti akina ɗǝmik kǝndǝdlom nǝ gumsi tǝn gaki ki pisi ulnǝ' manini u. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Adǝmi hwel gopti shilǝn ki Lya kǝn pa tǝn dlǝmi mbalǝn. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Ga'si unǝ satǝlakin kina ɗǝ gumsi' u, bǝ hwok kiniwai, ngo nǝnǝgu kini kǝmil shilǝnwai, Yalkimbatl ki Lya kǝn bǝtl kin ulki dlǝmi. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Yel'se nǝn bǝtl yel'sewasi as tloti, bwasi tǝn bǝtl yakuwasi mil nǝn tlǝlli' mikzi'si as laki a tlosi. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Mbalǝn nǝnnge'kini gaki shin ini, ngo nǝnǝgu mulnǝ a ngashbi nǝpatwasu tǝnpeti.”<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Besǝn Bǝna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Ka yenǝn a dllǝl bezǝn kyautǝn mull cik zhenti gelu unǝ bǝ a mbunwai u (mull dlǝm lashti tǝmmanica), Ginǝ ge' atl ki Yahudiya u as kitǝli as tege'zǝnga. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Mulnǝ ge libi ki lya u bǝppe' suɗi atte' libi gaki ka' ullǝnwai. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Mulnǝ agegu u bǝ pal te' ɗǝ ka' lulutwai. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Mi' tugi nǝ mi' mil kali age'cin u ulki cik go'kǝni! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Shilǝnni nǝ Lya bǝ ulu nda age' watlǝnwai. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Age cin u nǝnpǝl bezǝn lǝɓa u nǝ bǝ a pǝldlǝ gason wai u, tun nǝ Lya pǝl dǝplǝɓa, i mbǝl cin ki sǝti, kǝnpǝl u ndwas nǝwai, nǝpatiki dǝplǝɓa.<verse eid="MRK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />“Tǝ' Lya abosǝn mutti takawai u, da mulǝn kǝnsatwai, gaki ginǝ olsi i, in ndokǝl mutti taka. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Age cin u inmullǝn a ulkisu, ‘Yen Almasihu ngu u!’ Ko ‘yenǝn, ti ngwa!’ Bǝ ndǝniwai. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Gaki almasihu ki lǝgati nǝ mik njeshinkǝn ki Lya ki lǝgatti sǝn peti teɗi asi pǝl ulkǝ gagashinti tǝn gaki sǝ'gǝl ginǝ' olsi i, ǝnnǝn pǝtu. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Tǝngaki nǝgu a' pǝn ɗemɗem; apikini mus lǝɓa u nǝ nǝn ndatu.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Patl ki Yakǝn Mbalǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Amma age' muttyi, kalki bǝna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">“ ‘Cin nǝndǝp dǝmshal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">Liy kǝn cil nuwai.<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Cadlǝl nǝn gobti nda sullya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">Nǝn wu' bas lǝɓa ki lya.’<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />“Age' cin u mbalǝn nǝn ye' Yakǝn mbalǝn ɗǝ mbǝtige' ku'kuti, nǝ naltwasi nǝ ndǝlti. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Tǝnshik mil shinkǝnwas suɗi as dom ginǝ' olsi kal nǝ kina, tohna nǝ tohshimti, nǝ ngwatlti ki dǝplǝɓa nǝ ki lya.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cimbǝlti tǝn Pǝt ki Kah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Kulcin ulǝn tǝn pǝt ki kah: Kayenǝn tǝɓal dǝltu, manini watlǝn ɓal nja i. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Ɗaɗanu kayenǝn u ndigi ɗǝ ndatu, manini tǝɓal nja i, tǝn bidlabi kǝn tiɓali. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Balini, amipikkini, hwonnu kǝnpatwai, sainǝ mus usi a nda. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Lya nǝ atli nǝn pati amma shilǝn yini kǝnpa'twai.”<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Amma cini nǝ gasi isi, mullǝn maniwai ko mik shinkǝni ko Yakǝni, mul zǝtti mani katl. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Pǝn ɗemɗem! Dǝmni nǝ manti aki shilǝn nǝ Lya! Gaki ki manǝn gasi u nǝtǝ cin u mbǝ uwai. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Kǝnǝ mullǝ'lo kǝni: Isza' libiwasi ipbǝl zheliwasi kyautǝn ko gukǝni nǝ kyautǝnwasi, i'ul mul kitǝn dlabi usu Dlǝlgal. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Dlǝlnigal, gaki kǝmanǝn gasi unǝ tǝmullibini paluwai, ko asuti ko agasi ko abilucili ko nǝ kyau. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Bǝm mbǝ katl, ambikin ɗǝ nde' Yemmbuɗwai. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Ulna dlǝmmikini u, I ami pikkini: ‘dlǝlni galt!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Mikkina a Dlil Shilǝn i Si' Tlo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Mutti lob kǝn ɗǝ as pǝl daddaɓǝl ki ɗakǝshti ki biledi u' nǝ bǝ Yis ɗagibiwai u, I bas lǝɓasi ki Lya nǝ mi'lashti zhil ki Musa is ngau shitu u nǝ sǝ' gob Yesu ɗa u ki hwuni sǝ' tloti. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Is usu “Bǝspǝli ge' daddaɓǝl luwai, gaki ɓa mbalǝn tlǝl dlati.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">I Swati Yesu Mil mul Ulpi Abetani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu a Betaniya a libi ki mulnǝ si mbeti ki Saminu dakǝl. Ti ɗamti ngu, I kǝliwon mbǝ nǝ yakǝn lǝda gunǝs pǝli nǝ zǝnga ki onis, nǝ mil a giɓi ki naldi mul ulpi. It tatl lǝda mili, it ci ndǝlli' Yesu aga. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Ginǝ a lǝbi u is kum lwetl ki mbadlǝ, is ul yelsǝni su, “Ya lak kon nǝ milu ɗa nǝgu? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Tǝ'sa ulin taka u, ngǝtl upki ndacin ki hwon nǝm as bǝlginǝ bǝ ulǝn nisi ɗawai u, da nǝn gǝtlti!” Is mati kǝli isi. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Iki i Yesu usu. “Zakǝnti, Ya laki iki hwottiti ɗa? Ulki zokki tǝpǝlini. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Ginǝ bǝ ulǝn nisiɗawai u sinekkini ko gasiukǝni. Ko gasiukǝn ki lyamtini kin pǝlissi zo'lǝɓa, gaki ko gasi u kǝn kine'kǝnwai. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />I kǝliyi pǝl pǝl tiwasi. It bene mil adli it li'kǝnǝni kamin gutǝni. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Balini amipikkini, mus lu unǝ tǝ dlǝp shilǝn ki Lya tǝn dǝplǝɓa u, sin gobti dlǝb ulnǝ kǝli u pǝli u gaki da mbǝtlti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahuza Dǝgi Ti'bǝl Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />I Yahuza Iskalyoti, nǝm ge' mil kushtiwasi kutl nǝ lobpi, illǝma bas lǝɓasi ki Lya gaki tǝbbǝl yesu masi ɗa. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Nǝskumi nǝgu u is pǝlhwol mbatli, is ndigi sǝ'bǝlti ulpi. I' Yahuda ngwau shitu ki bǝlti.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Mil Kushtiwasi Ɗam Ulkiɗami Gelu Dadabǝl ki Ɗakǝshti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Cin ki nǝm ki dadabǝl ki biledi gunǝbǝ yis ɗagiɓiwai u, a kuɗi pǝtl dli i ɗǝ poshti yakǝn mbǝla gaki dadabǝl ki ɗakǝshti, i mil kushtiwas gyemti is usu, “A ukǝn ki lyamti tǝn le' likǝni' lu ɗap dadabǝl ki ɗakushti?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />I' shin mil kushtiwasi gudǝl lob, i' ulsisu, “Ten ge'gatli, kin mati nǝ mullǝn ki kami nǝ tobmal a' bǝlǝnti kali. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Ulǝn mullibi u nǝ' te giɓi usu, ‘Mul lashti ɗǝ ngau: kǝbsi nǝtǝ' dǝmi ti' ɗap ulki ɗami ki dadaɓǝl ki ɗakǝshti ne mil kushtiwasu?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Tǝn mbokikin toh tǝnbal kǝpson ki libi ki lya, gunǝ ki likǝni ki zoki. A lǝbi ki likǝnimi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />I' mil kushtiyi za'lǝbi, is su ge'gatli, is mbi ulisi kǝnǝ gunǝ Yesu dlǝmisi u. Is likǝn dadabǝl ki ɗakǝshti. <verse eid="MRK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Nǝ bisu pǝ u, i Yesu mbǝ ne' milkushtiwas kutl nǝ lob. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Asi ɗap ulki ɗami ngu, i Yesu usu, “balini amipi'kini, nǝm agekini tin bǝltǝni, gunǝ ti ɗamti nǝ ami u.” <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />I mikushwasi ispǝl du'tugi, asi ultisu nǝ nǝm nǝm, “ko a mini?” <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />I' ulsisu, “Nǝm ge' kutl nǝ lobpi gunǝ ami ɗamti ge' gal nǝm miti. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Ya'kǝn mbalǝn nǝn zǝ'ga, kan u nǝɗa kǝlaci tǝntu. Amma ulki zǝ'go'kǝni tǝnmulnǝ nǝn bǝtl yakǝn mbalǝn u, nǝn ngǝtli' muli tǝ azǝntwai.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulki ɗami ki mulban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Si ge' ɗamti, i Yasu kan biledi, nǝn ngem Lya u, iccaccali, ibbǝl mil kushti wasi, i' usu, “Kamini; guɓo dliyikǝni.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Iki i'kan mbǝgamal, kimal ki innabi iki in ngem Lya, ibbǝlsi, muswasǝn is tle a giɓi. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />“Guki hwulayini ki njikǝ' alkawali, gunǝ bǝna dli gaki mbalǝn u” i' ulsisu. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />“Bali ami pikkini, akǝn tle' malki innabi nuwai, sai gasiwu nǝta tle pyale' i ge' gu'ki Lya u.” <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Nǝs ulwul ki ndwa'ti Lya u, is peki is totǝn zǝga ki zaitun.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitlus Nǝn Nge' Ma' Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />I Yesu ulsisu, “Muswakǝn kǝn ndatini, ki laciɗa: ‘An li'ti mul byatl mbǝla i', mbǝla i nǝn dla'ti ga.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Amma kal ki tlǝl lya ini, an ngǝtltikin ɗǝ mbǝkǝshti a Galili.” <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />I Bitlus usu, “In muswasǝn sǝn ndatu, ami akǝn ndatwai.” <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />I Yesu ultisu, “Bali ami dlǝmi'ki, age' gasu, kapǝn tǝ guda la'yal asǝn lop, kǝn usu kǝmanǝn wai asǝn maki.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />I Bitlus go' dlǝmti nǝndǝlti ati usu, “In nǝn tlotǝn imimiku, akǝn nge' makkiwai.” Muswasǝnma nǝgu sǝ dlǝmi.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ngem Lya a Gatsemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Is lǝge'luwon nǝɗǝ mbettiki Gatsemani, i' ul mil kushtiwasisu, “dǝmniki ta shilǝn nǝ Lya.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />I' kan Bitlus nǝ Yakubu, nǝ Yahaya, a ge'nǝgu i wuli gop hwottiti a mbadlwasi, i wuli tlwedli. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />I' ulsisu “Mbadli ɗǝ bǝna, kǝnǝ ta mǝci. Dlilni aki, a dlilni gal.” <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Nǝ' ɓeukina ten ngulen u, in nda atli, in ngem Lya, i' usu, in nǝn pǝtu akami' bǝna u taka. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />I' usu, “Abba, Bwasinǝn, mus lǝɓa mul pǝkǝni amaki. Kami mbǝgamalu taka. Musnǝ nǝgu bǝ manti ki gayiwai, gwagi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ippal te ma' mil kushtiwasi im mbǝsi ɗǝ nde' yemmbuɗi, i' ul Bitlus su, “Bitlus! Nde' embukǝn kiɗaya? Kǝkǝn maddǝb kǝpǝdǝliwaiya? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Dǝmni ki pǝdǝli a ngemǝn Lya, ɓa'ndan ge' cibǝlti, yalki mbatl ki lya akami i' amma dli a ndǝlwai.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Ippal tya ɗaɗɗanu, in ngem Lya, kǝnǝ kiɗigi. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Nǝppal te'ɗu, im mbisi ɗǝ nde' yemmbuɗi, gaki yemmbu' a njikǝn dwaɗǝn wasǝn. Is hwol ulnǝ sǝ' dlǝmitu. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Patl te' ki makisi, i' ulsisu, “Kiɗi nde' yemmbuɗi aki shu'ta? Anjikǝn i! Cin ambǝ i. Yanini, sabǝl yakǝn mbalǝn a toh ɗǝ mi' pǝtl bezǝn laɓa i'. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Hillya! Mǝzǝnga! Mul bǝltǝn u ɓalu!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">A Gob Yesu i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Ti ge' shilǝn, Yahuda ngu, nǝm ge' mil kushtiwasi kutl nǝ lopi, im mbǝ ne' hwu' mbalǝn siki ngapi nǝ bas pǝga nǝ kumbǝl, bas lǝɓasi ki Lya, mi' lashti zhil ki Musa, ne' mi'kina shinsi suɗi. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Mulbǝtlti u, takǝndi nesi i, “Mulnǝ akucenttu, tiki mullisi: a'gobpǝnti, a'zǝngane'ti a'ngappǝnti kizeki.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Nǝ mbǝkki Yahuza, I'lǝmak Yesu, I' ultisu, “mullashti!” I'kucenti. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Imbalǝni gob Yesu is ngapti nǝ ndǝlti. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Nǝm ge' milkushti ki Yesu ki dlǝli nja nǝti, in ndust pǝga wasi ittele zheli ki bali ki bas lǝɓasi ki Lya nde'ti, ippa'ti kǝm. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />I Yesu ulsisu, “kipe'ni ton nǝ bas pǝga nǝ kuɓǝl wakǝn ki' gobpǝnnǝn ɗama ami mǝgǝlkǝma? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Ko gasiwu kǝni amine'kini, age' libi ki Lya ami dlǝp shilǝn ki Lya, kagobnǝnwai. Pǝlǝn dli nǝgu gaki tǝ shilǝnki Lya njikǝnǝnɗa.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Musswasǝn alǝbi is za'ti, is kitǝli. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Yakǝn giɗǝnsiwon gunǝ bǝ ulǝn nidɗa dliwai u amma ul idlatlti katl, ati bǝtl Yesu kal. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Nǝs'gob Yesu u, i' kitǝli bǝ ulǝn nidɗa dliwai, is zakkisi ul idlatti.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akina Ɗǝ mi'Dlitl Shilǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Is tǝla Yesu ma' ki bali ki bas lǝɓasi ki Lya, mus bas lǝɓasi, ne' mi'kina, ne' mi'lashti zhil ki Musa is domga ma'ti. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />I Bitlus bǝlti kali, alolu lolu, swa dlomban ɗǝ ki bali ki bas lǝɓasi ki Lya. Alǝbi iddǝm ne' mi'ɓutti dlabi, a ti ko'utu. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Bas laɓasi ne'mi'dlil shilǝn si ngau ulnǝ sǝm mbi tǝn Yesu u tǝdǝmki ta pǝl byaslǝɓayi sǝm mbi sǝ'tlotti ɗa, sa mbiwai. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Mbalǝn diɓǝli is lige'ga, biwasǝn anda nǝmwai. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />A ge' kale igyen, shali Yesu lǝga'ga: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Mǝkum ti usu, ‘Tǝn batti libi ki lya u nǝ mbalǝn kǝni nǝ toh u, a'kǝn kundu ge'mutti maki, gunǝ'bǝ kǝntiki toh wai u.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Mus nǝ nǝgu biwasǝn a nda nǝmwai. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />I ki bali ki bas lǝɓasi ki Lya hiliya akinawasǝn, ingem Yesu, i'ultisu, “Ulki dlimi ni'ɗawaiya? Shilǝn u nǝsi dlimti tǝnkupa?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Yesu a shilǝn wai ta dlǝmi' ulǝnwai. I ki bali ki bas lǝɓasi ki Lya ngemti ɗaɗɗanu, “Ko kiki Almasihu yakǝn ki mulnaltwa?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu usu, “Amini, kǝn ye' yakǝn mbalǝn kidǝmi tǝntohship ki mul ndǝl ki Lya, ti sussuɗi ge' kukkuti.” <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />I ki bali ki bas lǝɓasi kye'kyesh lulugǝllwasi. In gyemi, “Undǝ sheda ukǝn tǝn ngayin ɗaɗanu? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ka kumǝn musǝn Lya u nǝppǝli uwaiya. Ya kiyanǝni?” Mus i mbalǝni pochi shilǝn gaki sǝ'tloti. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />I gen gob bezetti makǝn, is kǝndi' dwaɗǝn, is lili'ti, si ultisu, “Dlǝmimi okǝn liki!” Mik ɓutti dlabi ki libi ki Lya is gob lilititi.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitlus Usu Tǝman Yesu Wai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Bitlus a atli adlomban ge' libini, I zheli Yakǝn kǝli kǝ bali ki bas lǝɓasi mbǝ. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Nǝ en Bitlus ɗiko' utu u, I' yati kizekki. I' ultisu, “Kima a yenǝnki nǝ Yesu, Banazelet tu!” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Amma i musǝn matti, i' usu, “Aman ulnǝ ki dlǝmti uwaima.” Nǝdl dlǝmi nǝgu u, i' hilya illǝbidla, alǝmdǝmtwai i guda la'yali. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />I zheli yakǝn kiliyi yenti, itl dlǝmi ginǝ ki dlǝli alǝbi u, “Guma age' si tiɗa.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Immusǝnte ɗaɗanu. Alǝn dǝmtwai, iki dlili i is ul Bitlus su, “Kima nǝmwasǝn kǝni, gaki kimul Galilini.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />I Bitlus pǝli gawas bi. Ati Lenceti, ati ussu, “Aman mulnǝ kishilǝn tǝntuwai.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Alǝbi alǝbi i guda la'yali asǝn lob. I Bitlus dambǝl shilǝn unǝ Yesu pitu, “Kapǝn tǝgunda la'yali ki asǝn lob, kǝnmusǝnti nǝ ami asǝn maki.” Nǝ' dambǝlli u, iki immbutlgekulu.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Akina ki Bilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Nǝcil kǝlu, bas lǝɓasi ki Lya nǝ mikkina ki lashti zhil ki Musa, mus mi' dlil shilǝn is dlǝl shilǝn. Tǝngaki sǝ' kǝndǝ Yesu, is ziga nǝti, is bǝl Bilatus ti. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />I Bilatus gyemti i' ultisu “Kiki guu ki Yahudawaya?” I Yesu ndǝgiti i'usu, “Nǝgu ki dlǝmi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />I bas lǝɓasi ki Lya is gob dagǝtlti tǝnlǝɓa diɓǝli. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />I Bilatus gyemti ɗanu i' ultisu, “Ki ngu, si dagǝtlti tǝn lǝɓa diɓǝli, kikǝn ndǝgissi waiya?” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Amma hal nǝguni Yesu appallisi shilǝnwai, i uli hwot Bilatus.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apoci Yesu Mǝshti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Ulnǝ guu kuɗi pelti agas cin ki dadabǝl tǝn zakkissi mulnǝmi nǝm kige' kulkuku gunǝ mbalǝn ngemi u. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Mulǝnɗa si mbettiki Balnabas gunǝ ki kǝndǝ age' kulkuku u, ne'mi'ndǝlkiga ginǝ mbǝ mǝshti age' cin ki ndǝlkiga. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />I dobga ki hwu mbalǝn is mbǝ ma'Bǝlatus tǝppǝlisi ulnǝ' kuɗǝ pǝlti u. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />I Bǝlatus ngemsi i'usu, “Ki lyamtini ta zakikkin guu ki Yahudawaya?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Gaki tamaniyi si usu gaki ngetti lakiɗa i bas lǝɓasi ki Lya bǝl Yesu a tohwasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />I bas lǝɓasi ki Lya is datti mbalǝn shilǝn bi, sǝ'usu tǝzzakisi Balnabas ge'shuki Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />I Bǝlatus ngyemsi ɗaɗanu, “I mikǝn ta pǝli nǝmulnǝ ki mbetti ki guu ki Yahudawa u?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Is mbǝl la'ti yal tǝnki ɗaɗanu asi usu, “Tolǝnti tǝn gadlǝnnga!” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />I Bǝlatus ngemsi, “Yalakiɗa? Bezǝn lǝɓa yakǝn tǝpǝli?” Is mbǝl tlǝlyal tǝnki asi usu, “Loti!” <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Bǝlatus ɗǝ lyamti tǝppǝli mbalǝn ulnǝ mba tlwasǝn ɗǝ lyamti u, is zakisi Balnabas. Illaki is lǝ' Yesu u, ibbǝli, sǝ' tolti tǝn gadlǝnnga.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sojoji is Laki Yesu Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />I sojoji zǝga nǝti a tya bidla ɗǝ guu, (iki bidla ki gunti) is domi diɓǝl sojoji ga. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Is laki'lulǝgǝl undi ki gumsi mul hwula gagi, is pǝl kulu gawon ki gumsi ki ili, is shimi'ga. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Is go'shinitti si usu, “Tǝ Lya pǝli'pyasti ki mutti guu ki Yahudawa!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Is go'li'titi aga nǝ kumbǝl, asi bezetti makǝn. Is ngus atli tǝnsi bǝtlti nalti. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Nǝspa' lakkitti bi nǝgu u, is tusi' lulǝgǝl ki guntisi taka, is lakki' lulǝgǝlwasi. Iki is sulti dla gaki sǝ'tloti.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atol Yesu tǝn Gadlǝnnga Yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Sige'zǝgga, sai mulǝn kǝngu ɗǝ ɓeuti, mulshin Siman, mulki Sayilin, mul zǝg Elekzanda nǝ Lupus, ti petite'ge' yakǝn gatlon, is la'ti nǝngesi ɗǝka' gadlǝnga ki Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Is tǝla Yesu ge'luwon si mbellǝbisi ki golgota, (iki “Luga mbalǝn”). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Alǝbi sitaki' malki inabi kigushli nǝ mul in nge tleti. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Iki is tolti tǝn gadlǝnga. Is bwas lulǝgǝlwasi age' dlomwasǝn, is pǝl kuli a tǝn gaki sǝ'en ulnǝ tǝ kowon ngi mbi u. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Nǝ dom ki nǝtapsi ki nikyeukǝn si tolti tǝn gadlǝnnga. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Is lash shilǝn ki dagǝtlti aga ɗa'ka, “Tiki Guki Yahudawa.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Is tol mǝgǝlsi lop tǝn gadlǝnnga ne'ti, gudǝl nǝm tǝn toh shimti, gudǝl nǝm tǝn tohna. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />[Gukǝ njikǝ'ki nasi u nǝ' usu, “Sa ɓǝtlti ge'mi' pǝl byas lǝɓa.”] <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Mi'ɓeuti is go'pitti du shilǝn du shilǝn ya' shuge mbalǝn, asi wuga, asi ussu, “Kiwunǝ kin batti libi ki Lya, a'kǝni ge'mutti makwa, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Pe'sutɗǝtǝn gǝdlǝnnga uɗa, a' Pe'kǝl gawa' ɗa!” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Nǝgu bas lǝɓasi ki Lya ne'mi' lashti zhil ki Musa is gob lakkittibi age' dlomwasǝn asi ussu, “Tapekǝl gen i', bǝtaman pekǝl gawa swai! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Almasihu u, guki isla'ila, tǝppe'sudɗǝ tǝn gǝdlǝnnga nǝgun ɗa, mima anyeni anla' mbatlɗa.” Ginǝs tloti ne'tu sima is gob byalti.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝshti ki Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />A bal dloncin, i dǝmshal idla atli, i dom maki ki su'pǝɗa. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Nǝ dom maki ki su'ti, i Yesu shilǝn nǝ ndǝlti i'usu, “Eloi, eloi, blama sabaktani?” (Iki, “Lya yini, Lya yini, ya lakiɗa i'lakǝntaka?”) <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Nǝ ginǝ ki dlili alǝbi kumi nǝgu u, is usu, “In ngu, timbe' Iliya bi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Nǝ mwasǝn kitǝli, i lap soso ge'mbya mal ishimi tǝn kumbǝl It taki Yesu gaki tǝtle, i ussu, “Dlilni tǝn ya nini ko Iliya nǝn pekǝlti suɗi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />I Yesu shilǝn nǝ ndǝlti, iki mǝshtwasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Iki labule kige libi ki Lya bwasi lǝbi lop, nǝ alya nǝ tli. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Mwani mul ndǝl ki mbalt, gunǝ ki dlǝlli akina ɗǝ Yesu u, nǝ' yen mǝshti, ki Yesu u i' usu, “Balini, mulu yakǝn ki Lya kǝni!” <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Mudli yen is dlǝltel lolu ɗǝ yallu. Ge'si Malyamu Magadaliya, nǝ Malyamu dyaki Yakubu Yakǝni nǝ Yusupu, nǝ Salomi. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />A te' Galili mudliyi bǝlti kali asi pǝlitti kyautǝn. Mudli yen ɗaɗanu diɓǝli nǝs mbǝne'ti a Ulshelima asi lǝbi.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agu Yesu I</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />A suti, ɗǝ mbǝtti tǝlu cillu cin ki shuti ki Yadudawa. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yusupu mbǝ, mulki Almatiya, mul dlil shilǝn kǝni, mul pǝli'mbalǝn zo'lǝɓa, mul ɓutti gukki Lya u, tǝ mbǝ. Ippǝl ndǝlki mbadli illǝma'Bilatus, in ngemi sǝ'bǝlti dliki Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />I Bilatus kum gagashinti nǝ'kumi Yesu a mǝccu. Imbe soja yibi in ngemti balima Yesu a mǝccuwa? <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Nǝm mani nǝgu u abiɗi soja u, ibbǝl Yusupu dli i. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />I Yusupu wul likkapani ki lilin. Nǝ'shi' Yesu u, illa'ti ge'li'kapani ki lili i, illa'ti ge'lu gum mbalǝn gunǝs ɗugi ge' zǝnga u, ibbǝdǝl zǝga i tǝn bishu gun mbalǝni. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Malyamu Magadaliya nǝ Malyamu dyaki Yusupu is yen lu u nǝs guti ɗa u.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Hillya ki Yesu Ge' mi'mǝshti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Nǝ cin shuti ɓe u, Malyamu Magadaliya, nǝ Malyamu dya ki Yakubu, nǝ Salomi, is ul mil ki tukǝni dli mul tǝmti, gaki sǝlle' tukǝ dli ki Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Gas cin ki kina ki shuti, a bilucili petito' kǝccin is lǝge'lu u nǝs gutiɗa u. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Asi tǝn shitu is ngem yelsǝnisu, “Okǝn jakǝnimmin yegǝn u taka ɗǝbi shu ki gum mbalǝn u?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Nǝs tlil ga lya u, is yeni, a jakǝn yegǝni taka malgǝni i, in ngu, balini. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Sisu'ge'lu gum mbalǝni, is yen yakǝn giɗǝnsiwon ki dǝmi tǝn toh shimti, ki dlili nǝ hwol lulǝgǝl. Is kum ɓanti. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Tine i'ulsisu, “Bǝ kumǝn ɓantwai. Yesu mul Nazalat kǝnki ngauhtiya? Gunǝs tolti tǝn gadlǝnngawa? Ta hilya tiɗawai. Yenǝn lu u nes la'ti ɗa u! <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Nǝgun u zǝnga ki dlimi mil kushtiwasi, nǝ Bitlus, ‘Yesu yinǝn ngǝltikin nǝ mbǝkǝshti a Galili, tyaka ki yenǝnti kǝnǝ kan u nǝ' dlimikini u.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />I mudliyi pe'nǝ kitǝl, uli a hwossi i asi nepti ki dli. Sa ul mulǝnsu ulǝnwai, gaki sikub ɓanti.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">I Yesu Mbǝl Gawas ma' Malyamu Magadaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Nǝ Yesu hilya ge' mi'mǝshtu nǝ kyeu gascin kǝkina ki shuti, im mbǝl gawas ma' Malyamu ki Magadala, kǝli u nǝ Yesu pe'kǝli' mi'gatli ningi u. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Tine is zǝga ille'dlǝmi mbalǝnyi nǝ, sine' Yesu teɗu, ginǝ si du mbadli, asi kulu. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Nǝs kumi Yesu a mǝci ta hilya u, tima kǝliyi i'enti, sine sala' mbatl nǝtiwai.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Mbǝl Gawas ma' Mil kushtiwasi Lop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Kalki nǝgu i Yesu bǝ gedli kishoti Immbǝl gawasi ma' mbalǝn yen'lob age' mil kushtiwasi asi lǝti ge' ya'kǝn gatlon. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />I lopi paltya is dlimi na yelsǝniyi nǝ sine' siyi, is nge nditi nǝ dlimtiwasǝn.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyautǝn u nǝ Yesu Bǝl Mil kushtiwasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Age' kale immbǝl gawas ma'kutl nǝ nǝmisi, sigawasǝn, nǝsi ɗamti u. Immatisi tǝn ngela'ti mbadlwasǝn nǝ ndilkǝ gawasǝn, sa ndi'nǝ ginǝ yen hillya wasuwai. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />I'ulsisu, “Zǝnga ge'dǝplǝɓa, ki'dlǝmi mus mbalǝn shilǝn ki Lya. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Mus ginǝ ala'mbadlu, i pǝlisi baptisma u, sǝm mbi' pe'ti. Mulnǝ a nge la'ti mbadlu tǝkǝn mbi' pe'twai. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Nǝn ye' ulki gagashinti ma' mi'la'ti mbadli, nǝ shinyikǝn sǝppekkǝl mi'gatli, sǝn shilǝnti nǝ undi biyen, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Sǝmma' ka' uci nǝ toh, sǝmma' tle' byaslǝɓa, kǝn pǝlissi ulǝnwai, sǝmma'zǝ' mil gottoh as ndoki.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akan Yesu Twa lyayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Ge' kalki Yesu apa pissi shilǝn i, is kanti twalya, iddǝm tǝn toshipki Lya. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />I mil kushtiwas peki, is go'dlǝb shilǝnki Lya, a Lya go' ɗǝtl isi, is mani bali shilǝn u nǝ' dlimisi u tu'tǝn ye'gagashintu nǝsi pǝli.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>